(427886, 39100, 11923, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to say I really like your interpretation of the challenge.  Nice and original.  :)</td>', 'I just wanted to say I really like your interpretation of the challenge.  Nice and original.  :)', '2003-09-24 04:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(427892, 38932, 11923, '<td valign="top">I very much like this image.  Particularly since it evokes rest to me, as most guitarists'' hands are very busy with their craft.  Only suggestion I can think of is a slightly tighter crop so the bits of color in the corners were gone (keeping the background black with the hands and guitar standing out), but really that''s being picky probably.  Nice strong image!</td>', 'I very much like this image.  Particularly since it evokes rest to me, as most guitarists'' hands are very busy with their craft.  Only suggestion I can think of is a slightly tighter crop so the bits of color in the corners were gone (keeping the background black with the hands and guitar standing out), but really that''s being picky probably.  Nice strong image!', '2003-09-24 04:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(427896, 38423, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the look of light on glass, this photograph seems to diffuse the light very well.  I''m no expert but it has a crispness to it and even though it''s not a real car I have this feeling of an impatient wait to get refueled so it can go.  Perhaps because of the blurred background?  Or I could just be insane!  ;)</td>', 'I love the look of light on glass, this photograph seems to diffuse the light very well.  I''m no expert but it has a crispness to it and even though it''s not a real car I have this feeling of an impatient wait to get refueled so it can go.  Perhaps because of the blurred background?  Or I could just be insane!  ;)', '2003-09-24 04:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(427898, 39183, 8085, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast. The upper left part of the image is too bright.</td>', 'Too much contrast. The upper left part of the image is too bright.', '2003-09-24 04:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(427899, 39170, 8085, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like how the whole frame is filled.</td>', 'Cute. I like how the whole frame is filled.', '2003-09-24 04:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(427900, 38455, 8085, '<td valign="top">Blurry.</td>', 'Blurry.', '2003-09-24 04:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(427904, 39311, 8085, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2003-09-24 04:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(427905, 38743, 11923, '<td valign="top">I gave this a bit lower score than it may have gotten otherwise, because for my tastes it is cropped a bit too small.  especially since the cat is mostly dark with little highlight.  It took me a few seconds to figure out it was even a cat, at first my eyes saw a pig!  Don''t ask me why! ... so my suggestion would be to allow a bit more of the cat to be visible.</td>', 'I gave this a bit lower score than it may have gotten otherwise, because for my tastes it is cropped a bit too small.  especially since the cat is mostly dark with little highlight.  It took me a few seconds to figure out it was even a cat, at first my eyes saw a pig!  Don''t ask me why! ... so my suggestion would be to allow a bit more of the cat to be visible.', '2003-09-24 04:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(427906, 38740, 8085, '<td valign="top">I don''t particularly like the black border around the picture. It distracts the eye''s focus.</td>', 'I don''t particularly like the black border around the picture. It distracts the eye''s focus.', '2003-09-24 04:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(427907, 38301, 8085, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2003-09-24 04:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(427908, 39113, 8085, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field. Good composition.</td>', 'Nice depth of field. Good composition.', '2003-09-24 04:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(427909, 39172, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the photograph but it was a bit blurry and perhaps a teeny bit too dark for me.  I''m not sure if you downsized it or not, but there seems to be some loss of clarity to the image.  An excellent content idea though!</td>', 'I like the idea of the photograph but it was a bit blurry and perhaps a teeny bit too dark for me.  I''m not sure if you downsized it or not, but there seems to be some loss of clarity to the image.  An excellent content idea though!', '2003-09-24 04:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(427910, 39037, 8085, '<td valign="top">Good composition but no oomph.</td>', 'Good composition but no oomph.', '2003-09-24 04:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(427911, 39317, 8085, '<td valign="top">Nice silohuette.</td>', 'Nice silohuette.', '2003-09-24 04:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(427912, 39361, 8085, '<td valign="top">Nice candid.</td>', 'Nice candid.', '2003-09-24 04:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(427913, 38920, 8085, '<td valign="top">Cropping the upper third of the photo will give it a better composition. The pier is too centered.</td>', 'Cropping the upper third of the photo will give it a better composition. The pier is too centered.', '2003-09-24 04:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(427914, 39062, 8085, '<td valign="top">The black borders are too thick and distracting.</td>', 'The black borders are too thick and distracting.', '2003-09-24 04:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(427939, 38424, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast in the picture. Love the incredible reflections in the water. The bird really pops out of the picture. Shadows in the feathers really make the bird seem real.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast in the picture. Love the incredible reflections in the water. The bird really pops out of the picture. Shadows in the feathers really make the bird seem real.', '2003-09-24 06:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(427941, 38950, 10084, '<td valign="top">Need more contrast to really bring the subject out of the picture. The closeness of colors almost gives a camoflage effect. Tweaking levels should also help.</td>', 'Need more contrast to really bring the subject out of the picture. The closeness of colors almost gives a camoflage effect. Tweaking levels should also help.', '2003-09-24 06:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(427946, 39122, 4258, '<td valign="top">What part depicts contemplations?</td>', 'What part depicts contemplations?', '2003-09-24 06:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(427954, 39378, 10799, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting on the right with what looks like the wires. The detail is good.</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting on the right with what looks like the wires. The detail is good.', '2003-09-24 06:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(427955, 39035, 10799, '<td valign="top">The rule of thirds would have helped this image I think.  I do like the slant of the chair so that all you see is the leg.</td>', 'The rule of thirds would have helped this image I think.  I do like the slant of the chair so that all you see is the leg.', '2003-09-24 06:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
