(427965, 38195, 10799, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if you could have shown the ledge more.  Great idea.  The cat looks very at home there.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if you could have shown the ledge more.  Great idea.  The cat looks very at home there.', '2003-09-24 06:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
