(427994, 39113, 11570, '<td valign="top">Very sharp nice capture.<br/> <br/>Nicely on the thirds, however I might have cropped it to get rid of the blurry red object in top left - it does pull the eye away from the bird.<br/> <br/>But in flight you do get to see the incredible colour in the wings.  So at rest they look a bit drab.</td>', 'Very sharp nice capture. Nicely on the thirds, however I might have cropped it to get rid of the blurry red object in top left - it does pull the eye away from the bird. But in flight you do get to see the incredible colour in the wings.  So at rest they look a bit drab.', '2003-09-24 07:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
