(428144, 38424, 6624, '<td valign="top">this was really difficult to decipher at first - nice capture</td>', 'this was really difficult to decipher at first - nice capture', '2003-09-24 09:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(428145, 39407, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo.  I''m not sure why you chose to go with the tungsten yellow tint rather than choose an appropriate white balance...</td>', 'This is a neat photo.  I''m not sure why you chose to go with the tungsten yellow tint rather than choose an appropriate white balance...', '2003-09-24 09:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(428154, 38198, 772, '<td valign="top">cute pic... i can''t see the ''challenge'' in this photo.. maybe i''m missing something...</td>', 'cute pic... i can''t see the ''challenge'' in this photo.. maybe i''m missing something...', '2003-09-24 10:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(428158, 38791, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful sky and lovely composition :)</td>', 'beautiful sky and lovely composition :)', '2003-09-24 10:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(428164, 38453, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting... I think this photo has several issues... 1 - the cropped person in the lower portion of the frame is quite awkward....  2 - where does this tie into the theme of ''at rest''?  This, to me, looks like a case of trying to use a title to squeeze a photo into the challenge where it simply doesn''t fit.  3 - the border color you chose here doesn''t seem to fit at all.  it''s not a similar or supporting color for any of the colors within the photo.</td>', 'interesting... I think this photo has several issues... 1 - the cropped person in the lower portion of the frame is quite awkward....  2 - where does this tie into the theme of ''at rest''?  This, to me, looks like a case of trying to use a title to squeeze a photo into the challenge where it simply doesn''t fit.  3 - the border color you chose here doesn''t seem to fit at all.  it''s not a similar or supporting color for any of the colors within the photo.', '2003-09-24 10:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(428168, 39095, 772, '<td valign="top">phenomenal shot... = 10</td>', 'phenomenal shot... = 10', '2003-09-24 10:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(428171, 39177, 12509, '<td valign="top">Like this one very much. It expresses IMHO very well the meaning of resting as "coming to an end" and shows as well a mixture of harmony and tense (different body postures, constrast foreground/background), which is so characteristic for resting, when you still feel the tense of the day''s work. Somehow I dislike the appearance of the mountain. Haze causes a somehow dirty colour. Anyway, nice shot.</td>', 'Like this one very much. It expresses IMHO very well the meaning of resting as "coming to an end" and shows as well a mixture of harmony and tense (different body postures, constrast foreground/background), which is so characteristic for resting, when you still feel the tense of the day''s work. Somehow I dislike the appearance of the mountain. Haze causes a somehow dirty colour. Anyway, nice shot.', '2003-09-24 10:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(428172, 39163, 772, '<td valign="top">good idea but bad execution.  This photo looks like it has been enlarged from a smaller image.  The pixelation here is horrible.</td>', 'good idea but bad execution.  This photo looks like it has been enlarged from a smaller image.  The pixelation here is horrible.', '2003-09-24 10:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(428174, 39172, 11570, '<td valign="top">The softness looks intentional but I feel that a sharper image in tone would have been better.</td>', 'The softness looks intentional but I feel that a sharper image in tone would have been better.', '2003-09-24 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(428176, 39120, 11570, '<td valign="top">Compositionally the right hand chair is the key "focus" i.e. on the thirds.<br/> <br/>Breaking the "rule of thirds" can work but I think this cat is too small in the shot for this to work in this case.<br/> <br/>The exposure is spot for the furniture and greenery and as spot editing is not permitted I suppose it would hve been hard to reduce the blown highlights.  But a pleasant capture overall.</td>', 'Compositionally the right hand chair is the key "focus" i.e. on the thirds. Breaking the "rule of thirds" can work but I think this cat is too small in the shot for this to work in this case. The exposure is spot for the furniture and greenery and as spot editing is not permitted I suppose it would hve been hard to reduce the blown highlights.  But a pleasant capture overall.', '2003-09-24 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(428177, 39355, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work... i can''t think of a better idea for ''at rest''... = 10</td>', 'excellent work... i can''t think of a better idea for ''at rest''... = 10', '2003-09-24 10:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(428178, 39404, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette reminds me of the old Marlborough ads.<br/> <br/>Certainly says "At rest"</td>', 'Nice silhouette reminds me of the old Marlborough ads. Certainly says "At rest"', '2003-09-24 10:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
