(428221, 39115, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting composition, but the white box in the lower left is a major distraction.</td>', 'this is an interesting composition, but the white box in the lower left is a major distraction.', '2003-09-24 10:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(428225, 39404, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful... classic... well done :) = 10</td>', 'beautiful... classic... well done :) = 10', '2003-09-24 10:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(428227, 39109, 6008, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the water is good and helps lead the eye to the boats, but I find with the narrow crop that the vast many boats of varying color combinations just seems too chaotic to be calming. There is nothing there for my eyes to rest on, other than back at the mast reflection, which seems to be my focal point.</td>', 'The reflection in the water is good and helps lead the eye to the boats, but I find with the narrow crop that the vast many boats of varying color combinations just seems too chaotic to be calming. There is nothing there for my eyes to rest on, other than back at the mast reflection, which seems to be my focal point.', '2003-09-24 10:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(428231, 39088, 6008, '<td valign="top">In shots were the focus is in the sky it is usually disappointing to have an overcast day and/or have the sky blown out. That said, the repetition of the balloons is interesting enough for the sky to not be too bad. Cropping a little more on the left would have removed the excess branches that distract a little.</td>', 'In shots were the focus is in the sky it is usually disappointing to have an overcast day and/or have the sky blown out. That said, the repetition of the balloons is interesting enough for the sky to not be too bad. Cropping a little more on the left would have removed the excess branches that distract a little.', '2003-09-24 10:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(428232, 39353, 11907, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photograph, but I really don''t see the "at rest"</td>', 'It''s a nice photograph, but I really don''t see the "at rest"', '2003-09-24 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(428234, 39225, 7543, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a gray haze over the shot, the dark areas go gray.</td>', 'Seems to be a gray haze over the shot, the dark areas go gray.', '2003-09-24 10:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(428235, 39175, 772, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the ''color'' in this photo, but i like everythign else about it, and the title is the best... this photo probably has some merit as a black and white too :) = 10</td>', 'I don''t like the ''color'' in this photo, but i like everythign else about it, and the title is the best... this photo probably has some merit as a black and white too :) = 10', '2003-09-24 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(428236, 39404, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, good shot.</td>', 'Nice framing, good shot.', '2003-09-24 10:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(428237, 39082, 772, '<td valign="top">you can photograph absolutely anything that isn''t moving and call it ''at rest'' :)  I like the composition on this photo as well as the contrast... nice work :)</td>', 'you can photograph absolutely anything that isn''t moving and call it ''at rest'' :)  I like the composition on this photo as well as the contrast... nice work :)', '2003-09-24 10:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(428238, 39420, 6405, '<td valign="top">Well done,white on white,nice exposure, 10 from me!</td>', 'Well done,white on white,nice exposure, 10 from me!', '2003-09-24 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(428240, 39142, 6008, '<td valign="top">The dark and light contrasts well, and her face has a daydreamy quality too. I find her looking at the camera to be a draw, as if she is encouraging the viewer to lay down and rest too. Her face is a little too central, perhaps putting her to one side could emphasis the ''come lay down with me'' feel by showing a roomy space for the viewer to fall into. I like it.</td>', 'The dark and light contrasts well, and her face has a daydreamy quality too. I find her looking at the camera to be a draw, as if she is encouraging the viewer to lay down and rest too. Her face is a little too central, perhaps putting her to one side could emphasis the ''come lay down with me'' feel by showing a roomy space for the viewer to fall into. I like it.', '2003-09-24 10:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
