(428462, 38212, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great colors and i like the silhouette of the ship and the person.  I wish the bike handle wasn''t there and the flare is a little distracting.  Overall, very nice image.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great colors and i like the silhouette of the ship and the person.  I wish the bike handle wasn''t there and the flare is a little distracting.  Overall, very nice image.  Good luck!', '2003-09-24 12:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
