(428809, 39346, 4967, '<td valign="top">Is this a double dapple doxie?  <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=10952" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">My Doxie</a> thats my double dapple baby China.  I guess they are great dogs to dress up hehehe... cute pic.</td>', 'Is this a double dapple doxie?  My Doxie thats my double dapple baby China.  I guess they are great dogs to dress up hehehe... cute pic.', '2003-09-24 15:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(428811, 39070, 11923, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo, the more it draws me in.  I definitely like the contrast in the colors and the shapes, as well as the inherent fragileness of the egg compared to the strength depicted in the chair and figure.  The color is very nice.  It does seem a bit fuzzy though I do not know if this was intentional or a result of downsizing - regardless it does give it a dreamlike quality.  Excellent job!</td>', 'The more I look at this photo, the more it draws me in.  I definitely like the contrast in the colors and the shapes, as well as the inherent fragileness of the egg compared to the strength depicted in the chair and figure.  The color is very nice.  It does seem a bit fuzzy though I do not know if this was intentional or a result of downsizing - regardless it does give it a dreamlike quality.  Excellent job!', '2003-09-24 15:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(428812, 39408, 3898, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting and washed out color hamper this photo. The angle of the shot is ok I think that if you waited until the sun was lower in the sky It would have been a better shot.</td>', 'Poor lighting and washed out color hamper this photo. The angle of the shot is ok I think that if you waited until the sun was lower in the sky It would have been a better shot.', '2003-09-24 15:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(428815, 39213, 3898, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, however the forground seems to be overexposed. I like the colors though.</td>', 'The composition is good, however the forground seems to be overexposed. I like the colors though.', '2003-09-24 15:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(428817, 38715, 11923, '<td valign="top">This little guy is all over adorable.  But beyond that I love the difference of color between him and the chair or whatever it is he''s sleeping on.  His face is definitely what draws your attention and the focus on it is excellent in my opinion.  Great job!</td>', 'This little guy is all over adorable.  But beyond that I love the difference of color between him and the chair or whatever it is he''s sleeping on.  His face is definitely what draws your attention and the focus on it is excellent in my opinion.  Great job!', '2003-09-24 15:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(428820, 39211, 3898, '<td valign="top">Why the raised border? It realy draws away from the photo.<br/>I think that the image should be rotated to level and the focus seems to be off. The lighting has blown the colors out a little to much. This would be a great colorful shot if the lighting was better.</td>', 'Why the raised border? It realy draws away from the photo.I think that the image should be rotated to level and the focus seems to be off. The lighting has blown the colors out a little to much. This would be a great colorful shot if the lighting was better.', '2003-09-24 15:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(428821, 38855, 11923, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph.  To me it gives an excellent feeling of peace, as the outer-ring of people all appear to be in the the process of an action (laughing) and yet the focus, and clarity is on the young lady looking directly at the camera.  That gives me a sense of stillness and calm - much like those moments you read about where two people make eye contact and the world stands still.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for, but that''s what it evoked to me.  :)</td>', 'I really like this photograph.  To me it gives an excellent feeling of peace, as the outer-ring of people all appear to be in the the process of an action (laughing) and yet the focus, and clarity is on the young lady looking directly at the camera.  That gives me a sense of stillness and calm - much like those moments you read about where two people make eye contact and the world stands still.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for, but that''s what it evoked to me.  :)', '2003-09-24 15:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(428822, 39236, 11923, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea behind this photograph, but I did find the intense light by the door a bit distracting.  Also, while I definitely like the ''distance'' shot, it did seem a little too far away making it hard to see much detail of the person in the corner.  Still, a good shot.  :)</td>', 'I liked the idea behind this photograph, but I did find the intense light by the door a bit distracting.  Also, while I definitely like the ''distance'' shot, it did seem a little too far away making it hard to see much detail of the person in the corner.  Still, a good shot.  :)', '2003-09-24 15:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(428825, 39143, 3898, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting and focus hamper this shot. The face should be in focus.</td>', 'Poor lighting and focus hamper this shot. The face should be in focus.', '2003-09-24 15:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(428831, 39404, 9976, '<td valign="top">This is a very original shot. The crop and angle are perfect. Very nice silhouette. Well done.<br/></td>', 'This is a very original shot. The crop and angle are perfect. Very nice silhouette. Well done.', '2003-09-24 15:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(428832, 38794, 3898, '<td valign="top">Toning is good however it look washed out to me. I like the composition and the subject placement. Nice work.</td>', 'Toning is good however it look washed out to me. I like the composition and the subject placement. Nice work.', '2003-09-24 15:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(428835, 39090, 3898, '<td valign="top">To much light. The subject is blown out. I cannot tell if the lizard is in focus or not. I don''t belive he is.</td>', 'To much light. The subject is blown out. I cannot tell if the lizard is in focus or not. I don''t belive he is.', '2003-09-24 15:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(428836, 38640, 3898, '<td valign="top">To much back lighting. Good composition.</td>', 'To much back lighting. Good composition.', '2003-09-24 15:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(428837, 38201, 3898, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting although it has blown out some areas of the photo. I like the composition and focus.</td>', 'Nice lighting although it has blown out some areas of the photo. I like the composition and focus.', '2003-09-24 15:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(428838, 38481, 3898, '<td valign="top">Looks like you oversharpened in post processing. I think that the composition is good and the dof is ok.</td>', 'Looks like you oversharpened in post processing. I think that the composition is good and the dof is ok.', '2003-09-24 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
