(428861, 38365, 3867, '<td valign="top">This could have been a very good photography with softer lighting.  Nice composition and a good attention getter but way too much contrast.  The bright areas completely bleed out.</td>', 'This could have been a very good photography with softer lighting.  Nice composition and a good attention getter but way too much contrast.  The bright areas completely bleed out.', '2003-09-24 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(428862, 39199, 12139, '<td valign="top">Does not meet criteria for challenge. Nothing is sitting or lying on anything... Like the photo, though.</td>', 'Does not meet criteria for challenge. Nothing is sitting or lying on anything... Like the photo, though.', '2003-09-24 15:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(428863, 38235, 7628, '<td valign="top">The red sky is surreal.  I liked it better in the thumbnail where it looked more subtle.  I like the composition, the solitary feel.  the pic does show rest, relief after the storm. 7</td>', 'The red sky is surreal.  I liked it better in the thumbnail where it looked more subtle.  I like the composition, the solitary feel.  the pic does show rest, relief after the storm. 7', '2003-09-24 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(428864, 39107, 12467, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2003-09-24 15:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(428865, 39113, 3867, '<td valign="top">Nice nature shot.  Good color, contrast and I love the composition the way you put the subject off to the lower right with the branch running linearly accross the bottom and the blurred brown object in the top left.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice nature shot.  Good color, contrast and I love the composition the way you put the subject off to the lower right with the branch running linearly accross the bottom and the blurred brown object in the top left.  Good job!', '2003-09-24 15:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(428866, 39388, 2261, '<td valign="top">Very creative, it really does look like a vagina! 10</td>', 'Very creative, it really does look like a vagina! 10', '2003-09-24 15:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(428867, 39401, 12524, '<td valign="top">It would be nice if he was drunk, but no drunk can put the caps back on bottles that well!</td>', 'It would be nice if he was drunk, but no drunk can put the caps back on bottles that well!', '2003-09-24 15:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(428868, 38629, 12467, '<td valign="top">Almost too soft, but  a lovely pic!</td>', 'Almost too soft, but  a lovely pic!', '2003-09-24 15:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(428870, 39220, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture.  Filled with a glowing, warm, restful light.  I like the connection I feel between the siblings,  A favorite. 9</td>', 'Lovely picture.  Filled with a glowing, warm, restful light.  I like the connection I feel between the siblings,  A favorite. 9', '2003-09-24 15:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(428871, 38345, 11923, '<td valign="top">I gave this a lower score than it may have received in a different challenge mainly because it didn''t seem to fit the challenge parameters.  The subject didn''t appear to be in a restful state to me and instead of instilling calm (though the title gives me a hint as to the thought behind the photo) it actually gave me a feeling of menace or looming.  That said, I do like the black against blue and find the picture interesting.</td>', 'I gave this a lower score than it may have received in a different challenge mainly because it didn''t seem to fit the challenge parameters.  The subject didn''t appear to be in a restful state to me and instead of instilling calm (though the title gives me a hint as to the thought behind the photo) it actually gave me a feeling of menace or looming.  That said, I do like the black against blue and find the picture interesting.', '2003-09-24 15:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(428874, 39305, 12467, '<td valign="top">This give off a very somber, almost depressing feeling to me.  Not my kind of subject mattter, but technically well done</td>', 'This give off a very somber, almost depressing feeling to me.  Not my kind of subject mattter, but technically well done', '2003-09-24 15:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(428875, 38435, 2261, '<td valign="top">For me this is the very worst kind of photo to be posted here, it means nothing to anyone that does not know this child. It belongs in your album, you should only bore your friends and family with this.  There is no technical merit what so ever. 1</td>', 'For me this is the very worst kind of photo to be posted here, it means nothing to anyone that does not know this child. It belongs in your album, you should only bore your friends and family with this.  There is no technical merit what so ever. 1', '2003-09-24 15:57:09.000000', NULL, 1);
