(428879, 38916, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great pose!  Basking in the sunlight. You captured the texture of the wet fur well too.  I wonder how it would look less pink? 7</td>', 'Great pose!  Basking in the sunlight. You captured the texture of the wet fur well too.  I wonder how it would look less pink? 7', '2003-09-24 15:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(428880, 38663, 11923, '<td valign="top">I gave this a lower rating because the darkness of the photo had me straining to see the composition or any detail.</td>', 'I gave this a lower rating because the darkness of the photo had me straining to see the composition or any detail.', '2003-09-24 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(428882, 38423, 12390, '<td valign="top">very good! <br/>I like the twinge of yellow.</td>', 'very good! I like the twinge of yellow.', '2003-09-24 15:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(428883, 38937, 7628, '<td valign="top">I get the impression this was a fleeting "rest"  I like the colors and composition, the anticipation in the eyes.  The window looks like a halo - a neon, modern halo - hinting at patience and grace inside this child.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I get the impression this was a fleeting "rest"  I like the colors and composition, the anticipation in the eyes.  The window looks like a halo - a neon, modern halo - hinting at patience and grace inside this child. ', '2003-09-24 16:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(428884, 39173, 12467, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not quite as centered as it could be; I find the flowers distracting</td>', 'Perhaps not quite as centered as it could be; I find the flowers distracting', '2003-09-24 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(428885, 38997, 12467, '<td valign="top">NIce contrasts</td>', 'NIce contrasts', '2003-09-24 16:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(428887, 39169, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the predominance of gray -and how well you can see the different grays.  It is a restful, yet interesting monotone - with a peek of pink, green, and brown.</td>', 'I like the predominance of gray -and how well you can see the different grays.  It is a restful, yet interesting monotone - with a peek of pink, green, and brown.', '2003-09-24 16:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(428889, 39074, 7628, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of American Gothic.  Very proper, settled.  Nicely balanced composition.</td>', 'Reminds me of American Gothic.  Very proper, settled.  Nicely balanced composition.', '2003-09-24 16:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(428890, 38920, 3867, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I love the way the haze fades the pier while keeping the subject in the forground in higher contrast.  The angle of the shoreline works well to add dynamics to the horizontal and vertical lines of the pier.  Good photo.</td>', 'Nice shot. I love the way the haze fades the pier while keeping the subject in the forground in higher contrast.  The angle of the shoreline works well to add dynamics to the horizontal and vertical lines of the pier.  Good photo.', '2003-09-24 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(428891, 38719, 3898, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could be better if it was in color.</td>', 'I think this shot could be better if it was in color.', '2003-09-24 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(428892, 38656, 12452, '<td valign="top">great color and setting.....<br/> <br/>10 in my opinion.....<br/> <br/>JJAY</td>', 'great color and setting..... 10 in my opinion..... JJAY', '2003-09-24 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(428893, 39377, 7628, '<td valign="top">A feeling of dusk after a busy day.  I can feel the cool air coming off the water. The dim colors and lazy line of mountains add to the feeling of rest.</td>', 'A feeling of dusk after a busy day.  I can feel the cool air coming off the water. The dim colors and lazy line of mountains add to the feeling of rest.', '2003-09-24 16:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
