(429115, 39409, 7364, '<td valign="top">holy crap, nice bathroom!  This is a great pic.  The only fault I can find with it is the 2 white lights that appear to be behind the camera.  They''re casting an unnatural hue on the tub and bubbles and creating reflections on the faucet, tub, and bottle, and woman''s face.  If the color fo this ight was more like candle light it probably would blend in and enhance the picture well.  Nice job, good concept.</td>', 'holy crap, nice bathroom!  This is a great pic.  The only fault I can find with it is the 2 white lights that appear to be behind the camera.  They''re casting an unnatural hue on the tub and bubbles and creating reflections on the faucet, tub, and bottle, and woman''s face.  If the color fo this ight was more like candle light it probably would blend in and enhance the picture well.  Nice job, good concept.', '2003-09-24 18:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
