(429416, 39353, 7969, '<td valign="top">Hmm at first I thought this was a macro shot of a lightbulb some how, but on second look I see the ''lights'' in the background amd then there is white light, from a flash perhaps??, I think any shot that holds my attention as long as yours has deserves a good score, though I am sure you will get the barrage of ''not topic'' comments, I find lots to look at here, interesting well done shot.</td>', 'Hmm at first I thought this was a macro shot of a lightbulb some how, but on second look I see the ''lights'' in the background amd then there is white light, from a flash perhaps??, I think any shot that holds my attention as long as yours has deserves a good score, though I am sure you will get the barrage of ''not topic'' comments, I find lots to look at here, interesting well done shot.', '2003-09-24 20:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(429418, 39148, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well technically, (background I am refering to here) is not that great.  The fact however that you got a dig and rabbit (who match none the less) to sit contentedly is an impressive capture IMO. Well done.</td>', 'Well technically, (background I am refering to here) is not that great.  The fact however that you got a dig and rabbit (who match none the less) to sit contentedly is an impressive capture IMO. Well done.', '2003-09-24 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(429419, 38794, 7969, '<td valign="top">Definetly one of my top picks for this challenge, I like the tones, the composition, the subject. I love the vastness of the space in the background and the way the foreground pops out.  The sky looks as if you painted it by hand. This shot is so well I wonder if it is a PS one.  Anyway I love it.  Very well done.</td>', 'Definetly one of my top picks for this challenge, I like the tones, the composition, the subject. I love the vastness of the space in the background and the way the foreground pops out.  The sky looks as if you painted it by hand. This shot is so well I wonder if it is a PS one.  Anyway I love it.  Very well done.', '2003-09-24 20:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(429423, 39103, 11738, '<td valign="top">My cat does the same silly thing.  They must like to look at things upside down.  Nice shot but focus seems to be off a little where the middle of the cat''s back reaches the couch.</td>', 'My cat does the same silly thing.  They must like to look at things upside down.  Nice shot but focus seems to be off a little where the middle of the cat''s back reaches the couch.', '2003-09-24 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(429424, 39247, 11738, '<td valign="top">great shot of dolphins, but these guys don''t look at rest with their heads pooping out of the water like that.  Not a natural thing for dolphins to do, I guess.</td>', 'great shot of dolphins, but these guys don''t look at rest with their heads pooping out of the water like that.  Not a natural thing for dolphins to do, I guess.', '2003-09-24 20:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(429427, 39142, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but too dark.  A suggestion might be to have your model wear a pale colored- solid (no pattern) shirt so that she would stand out a little more.  Also, the dark pillow completely camouflages what seems to be a very beautiful head of hair.</td>', 'Nice shot but too dark.  A suggestion might be to have your model wear a pale colored- solid (no pattern) shirt so that she would stand out a little more.  Also, the dark pillow completely camouflages what seems to be a very beautiful head of hair.', '2003-09-24 20:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(429428, 38212, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but lose the guy with speedo in the foreground.  I realize that you may have been using him to block excessive glare, but his clothing or lack thereof puts a downer on this pic.</td>', 'Nice picture but lose the guy with speedo in the foreground.  I realize that you may have been using him to block excessive glare, but his clothing or lack thereof puts a downer on this pic.', '2003-09-24 20:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(429432, 38993, 11738, '<td valign="top">Bugs, bugs and still more bugs.  Good shot of yet another preying mantis.  Are blue eyes a normal colour or did you achieve this through editing?  Almost looks like it''s waving.</td>', 'Bugs, bugs and still more bugs.  Good shot of yet another preying mantis.  Are blue eyes a normal colour or did you achieve this through editing?  Almost looks like it''s waving.', '2003-09-24 21:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(429433, 39347, 11738, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  Does the dog always sleep like this, or only when the lights are on?  I would have cropped either a bit less on the left or a little more on the right.</td>', 'I love this shot!  Does the dog always sleep like this, or only when the lights are on?  I would have cropped either a bit less on the left or a little more on the right.', '2003-09-24 21:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(429436, 38673, 12537, '<td valign="top">very  very cute</td>', 'very  very cute', '2003-09-24 21:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(429439, 39107, 12537, '<td valign="top">i love this one theres nothing like a car ride to make you fall asleep</td>', 'i love this one theres nothing like a car ride to make you fall asleep', '2003-09-24 21:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(429440, 39141, 11738, '<td valign="top">Beautiful woman.  I also like the B&amp;W treatment and the lighting is also good.  And I can''t resist this anymore... nice legs.  Ok... have to stop looking and move to voting on other images :(</td>', 'Beautiful woman.  I also like the B&W treatment and the lighting is also good.  And I can''t resist this anymore... nice legs.  Ok... have to stop looking and move to voting on other images :(', '2003-09-24 21:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(429445, 39389, 12537, '<td valign="top">good depiction of being at rest, its original and very effective</td>', 'good depiction of being at rest, its original and very effective', '2003-09-24 21:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(429450, 39185, 10978, '<td valign="top">A really cool shot, but the bird is a bit out of focus.  It looks like his eyes are closed, interesting place to take a rest, I like it.</td>', 'A really cool shot, but the bird is a bit out of focus.  It looks like his eyes are closed, interesting place to take a rest, I like it.', '2003-09-24 21:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(429451, 38619, 10978, '<td valign="top">great lighting, and even though I do not see a person, i can just imagine them off resting after a long day..good job 7</td>', 'great lighting, and even though I do not see a person, i can just imagine them off resting after a long day..good job 7', '2003-09-24 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(429453, 39107, 11738, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I love how the sun is flooding your picture with soft yellow light.  You''ve taken a picture that would have been ho-hum and pushed it to a much more interesting composition.</td>', 'I like this.  I love how the sun is flooding your picture with soft yellow light.  You''ve taken a picture that would have been ho-hum and pushed it to a much more interesting composition.', '2003-09-24 21:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(429456, 38325, 10799, '<td valign="top">I thought of this idea but I was not sure it fit the challenge since the subject was to be securely placed, seated, or lying..... <br/>I think for the tree you should have used the rule of thirds in the composition as you did for the water and sky.  <br/>After reading the forum I came back to reevaluate some of my voting and comments.  There is a restful feeling to the photo and there is an object securely placed...</td>', 'I thought of this idea but I was not sure it fit the challenge since the subject was to be securely placed, seated, or lying..... I think for the tree you should have used the rule of thirds in the composition as you did for the water and sky.  After reading the forum I came back to reevaluate some of my voting and comments.  There is a restful feeling to the photo and there is an object securely placed...', '2003-09-24 21:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(429458, 39407, 11738, '<td valign="top">That''s funny.  They''re going to put you in the tank for it, but I commend you for having the guts to submit it.</td>', 'That''s funny.  They''re going to put you in the tank for it, but I commend you for having the guts to submit it.', '2003-09-24 21:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(429461, 38325, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  It might be a bit more dynamic if the tree weren''t quite as centered but more to one or the other side.  Also, I''m not totally sure, but I think most digital cameras can be set so the date/time doesn''t show on the picture; the info is kept in the EXIF data, but not on the picture, which is nice.  You might want to reset your camera for this.  I love the sun behind the tree trunk!  ~6</td>', 'Nice shot.  It might be a bit more dynamic if the tree weren''t quite as centered but more to one or the other side.  Also, I''m not totally sure, but I think most digital cameras can be set so the date/time doesn''t show on the picture; the info is kept in the EXIF data, but not on the picture, which is nice.  You might want to reset your camera for this.  I love the sun behind the tree trunk!  ~6', '2003-09-24 21:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(429463, 39355, 10799, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I understand the title and how it applies to the photo.  You have gotten me curious!  I like the blue /black tones and the far wall.  I am not sure  the arms look restful... but rather I see motion blurr especially where the arm blends into the side wall.  <br/>It looks like the photo needs to be rotated a bit.  It is not far enough from being level to look like it is supposed to be leaning to one side and yet it is not quite level so it distracts to me. <br/> lt is interesting.</td>', 'I am not sure I understand the title and how it applies to the photo.  You have gotten me curious!  I like the blue /black tones and the far wall.  I am not sure  the arms look restful... but rather I see motion blurr especially where the arm blends into the side wall.  It looks like the photo needs to be rotated a bit.  It is not far enough from being level to look like it is supposed to be leaning to one side and yet it is not quite level so it distracts to me.  lt is interesting.', '2003-09-24 21:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(429465, 38852, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful smile and eyes, good picture.  Did you try cropping a bit more off the top of the picture, maybe right below the little yellow mark at the top right?  I wonder if the picture might be a bit more effective that way.  Something to try.  It''s a beautiful picture as it is though.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful smile and eyes, good picture.  Did you try cropping a bit more off the top of the picture, maybe right below the little yellow mark at the top right?  I wonder if the picture might be a bit more effective that way.  Something to try.  It''s a beautiful picture as it is though.  ~8', '2003-09-24 21:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(429466, 39213, 5112, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Are those papayas in the front?  It''s interesting to see all the torn newspaper (to keep the fruit fresh I imagine?).  I love the colours in this picture.  ~8</td>', 'Cool!  Are those papayas in the front?  It''s interesting to see all the torn newspaper (to keep the fruit fresh I imagine?).  I love the colours in this picture.  ~8', '2003-09-24 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(429468, 38401, 11738, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how this represents rest... really I don''t.  Nice shot of a pretty lady though.</td>', 'I have no idea how this represents rest... really I don''t.  Nice shot of a pretty lady though.', '2003-09-24 21:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(429469, 38666, 12537, '<td valign="top">is a good idea but it looks like shes dead</td>', 'is a good idea but it looks like shes dead', '2003-09-24 21:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(429470, 38943, 10799, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this.  It has a dreamy quality.  I think it would be nice to have it a bit clearer and let the light give it the soft quality... It fingers especially are too fuzzy to me.  I really like the light on the wings.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this.  It has a dreamy quality.  I think it would be nice to have it a bit clearer and let the light give it the soft quality... It fingers especially are too fuzzy to me.  I really like the light on the wings.', '2003-09-24 21:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(429472, 38828, 5112, '<td valign="top">What a cool critter!  He/she reminds me of some ladies I know at church,  with the honest, smiling face, gentle look, monotone clothing, hands primly in front, whatever.  Anyway.  I hope you never show up at my church :)  I like the frame.  ~8</td>', 'What a cool critter!  He/she reminds me of some ladies I know at church,  with the honest, smiling face, gentle look, monotone clothing, hands primly in front, whatever.  Anyway.  I hope you never show up at my church :)  I like the frame.  ~8', '2003-09-24 21:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(429473, 39223, 5112, '<td valign="top">I just looked at another picture with an animal that looks very much like this one!  Might it be the same animal?  Who knows ... Anyway, this one also has a neat expression.  Nice picture.</td>', 'I just looked at another picture with an animal that looks very much like this one!  Might it be the same animal?  Who knows ... Anyway, this one also has a neat expression.  Nice picture.', '2003-09-24 21:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
