(429482, 38464, 2716, '<td valign="top">Yes.  That is great!   good job at placing the cat in back.  Congrats on a good take.  Jacio. 9</td>', 'Yes.  That is great!   good job at placing the cat in back.  Congrats on a good take.  Jacio. 9', '2003-09-24 21:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
