(429487, 39082, 10799, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in this photo.  They are clean and crisp.  The unexpected small bit of red is nicely done too.  I wouldn''t necessarilly think  this would be a picture that says rest but this photo does evoke that feeling to some degree.</td>', 'I like the lines in this photo.  They are clean and crisp.  The unexpected small bit of red is nicely done too.  I wouldn''t necessarilly think  this would be a picture that says rest but this photo does evoke that feeling to some degree.', '2003-09-24 21:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(429488, 39337, 3697, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this one, I thought that the background and sky were blown out and overexposed. But the more I looked at it, the more I realized I liked those characteristics as the subject of the photo (the statue) was highlighted. Very nice job.</td>', 'When I first looked at this one, I thought that the background and sky were blown out and overexposed. But the more I looked at it, the more I realized I liked those characteristics as the subject of the photo (the statue) was highlighted. Very nice job.', '2003-09-24 21:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
