(429494, 39220, 4482, '<td valign="top">This is my prediction for the winner. ;-)  I''m so glad neat image wasn.t used to "barbify" those 2 cuties. Envokes peace and calm,  perfect lighting, great expressions. 9</td>', 'This is my prediction for the winner. ;-)  I''m so glad neat image wasn.t used to "barbify" those 2 cuties. Envokes peace and calm,  perfect lighting, great expressions. 9', '2003-09-24 21:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
