(429922, 39224, 5603, '<td valign="top">Last day of summer?  Well who the hell are YOU to decide that it''s the last day of summer?   And what''s with that swamp?  And what''s with that leash, where''s the frigging dog?  Oh let me guess, it chased a beagle en route to a shit pile.  You never fail to upset me.  And the clothes on your model are so screwy I can''t tell if she''s wearing white pants or if she''s sitting in a pile of bird shit.  Why don''t you trade in your camera for a dildo?  I''m very upset.<br/></td>', 'Last day of summer?  Well who the hell are YOU to decide that it''s the last day of summer?   And what''s with that swamp?  And what''s with that leash, where''s the frigging dog?  Oh let me guess, it chased a beagle en route to a shit pile.  You never fail to upset me.  And the clothes on your model are so screwy I can''t tell if she''s wearing white pants or if she''s sitting in a pile of bird shit.  Why don''t you trade in your camera for a dildo?  I''m very upset.', '2003-09-25 02:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
