(429942, 39062, 7531, '<td valign="top">I like this slightly too dark on the left though, did you use a gradient map? If the light was as is shown coming from the right, then spot metering would have been useful or exposure bracketing. None the less I like the composition a lot =9</td>', 'I like this slightly too dark on the left though, did you use a gradient map? If the light was as is shown coming from the right, then spot metering would have been useful or exposure bracketing. None the less I like the composition a lot =9', '2003-09-25 04:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
