(429944, 38795, 7531, '<td valign="top">Quite nice from the abstract side of things, like the fact that the guy looks like he''s relaxing and calm. Focus is an issue for him though, guess you used flash here. I like this though</td>', 'Quite nice from the abstract side of things, like the fact that the guy looks like he''s relaxing and calm. Focus is an issue for him though, guess you used flash here. I like this though', '2003-09-25 04:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
