(429947, 38794, 11923, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this photo at its basic level, but I feel as though the dog and the vista are competing for the viewers attention.  The dog also tends to get slightly lost against the background with the similarities in color between it and the mountains, but I can appreciate the differences in texture between its fur and the mountain.  I do like that aspect.</td>', 'I enjoy this photo at its basic level, but I feel as though the dog and the vista are competing for the viewers attention.  The dog also tends to get slightly lost against the background with the similarities in color between it and the mountains, but I can appreciate the differences in texture between its fur and the mountain.  I do like that aspect.', '2003-09-25 04:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(429948, 39099, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this photograph.  Its very earthy and has a natural feel to it, plus it evokes serenity and rest to me perfectly - and in a rather unique way.  Where is this taken?  I love it!</td>', 'I love the composition of this photograph.  Its very earthy and has a natural feel to it, plus it evokes serenity and rest to me perfectly - and in a rather unique way.  Where is this taken?  I love it!', '2003-09-25 04:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(429950, 38894, 7531, '<td valign="top">Come on now imagination, start to let those creative juices flow, this is a snapshot of your dog, ok it is at rest, but 0 impact as a photograph. Try to think of more interesting subjects, bend your mind a little, try to have IMPACT</td>', 'Come on now imagination, start to let those creative juices flow, this is a snapshot of your dog, ok it is at rest, but 0 impact as a photograph. Try to think of more interesting subjects, bend your mind a little, try to have IMPACT', '2003-09-25 04:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(429952, 39281, 11923, '<td valign="top">The kitties are beautiful, I really like the smokey one!  I did find the photo a bit difficult though because of the blurred aspect of it.  I don''t know if that was a deliberate choice, but for me it detracts from the photograph, over emphasizing the softness of the cats'' fur and making it a strain to see detail.</td>', 'The kitties are beautiful, I really like the smokey one!  I did find the photo a bit difficult though because of the blurred aspect of it.  I don''t know if that was a deliberate choice, but for me it detracts from the photograph, over emphasizing the softness of the cats'' fur and making it a strain to see detail.', '2003-09-25 04:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
