(430138, 39082, 1368, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I love taking pictures of these things But I havent got one as good as this one I love how they all point in the same directions and the bridge (or whatever it is) above too Only thing is the light on the right (you should have chopped it down ;) ) Mabey a bit little crop of the bottom and the top, Anyway good job - 8</td>', 'Very cool! I love taking pictures of these things But I havent got one as good as this one I love how they all point in the same directions and the bridge (or whatever it is) above too Only thing is the light on the right (you should have chopped it down ;) ) Mabey a bit little crop of the bottom and the top, Anyway good job - 8', '2003-09-25 10:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(430140, 39351, 10799, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective on this shot.</td>', 'interesting perspective on this shot.', '2003-09-25 10:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(430141, 38630, 10799, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the area of the leaf where it turns up.  I am not sure I would say the subject is securely placed.  I would think the water will move and so will the leaf.</td>', 'I like the color and the area of the leaf where it turns up.  I am not sure I would say the subject is securely placed.  I would think the water will move and so will the leaf.', '2003-09-25 10:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
