(430188, 39308, 9643, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo and the time of day/evening aspect.  The picture and title evokes for me the sweetness of that "silence".  The sky portion of the picture is very mottled or flat though and I have no suggestions because I''m new at this, get the same texture sometimes, and haven''t figured out for myself how to avoid it or correct it.  In spite of this I applaud your effort.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo and the time of day/evening aspect.  The picture and title evokes for me the sweetness of that "silence".  The sky portion of the picture is very mottled or flat though and I have no suggestions because I''m new at this, get the same texture sometimes, and haven''t figured out for myself how to avoid it or correct it.  In spite of this I applaud your effort.', '2003-09-25 11:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
