(430314, 39330, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  I like the way the natural light is emphasizing your subject.  As an experiment, I would suggest instead of the sideshot, something more straight on and a tighter crop leaving just the cat and the window, I think with the resulting thin black background (or border if you decided to do that) it would ''pop'' a bit more.</td>', 'Nice photo!  I like the way the natural light is emphasizing your subject.  As an experiment, I would suggest instead of the sideshot, something more straight on and a tighter crop leaving just the cat and the window, I think with the resulting thin black background (or border if you decided to do that) it would ''pop'' a bit more.', '2003-09-25 13:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
