(430324, 39076, 11923, '<td valign="top">Rest?  From the looks of it this bad boy just may be Rip Van Winkle.  I really like the fall colors against the dark and rusted body of this vehicle.  Not only that, but I find the contrast between the strength of the steel and the delicacy of the fallen leaves to make the picture even more interesting.  I get a sense of having been conquered and slowly languishing into oblivion.  Wonderful vision!</td>', 'Rest?  From the looks of it this bad boy just may be Rip Van Winkle.  I really like the fall colors against the dark and rusted body of this vehicle.  Not only that, but I find the contrast between the strength of the steel and the delicacy of the fallen leaves to make the picture even more interesting.  I get a sense of having been conquered and slowly languishing into oblivion.  Wonderful vision!', '2003-09-25 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
