(430817, 39308, 11800, '<td valign="top">This would have a lot more impact if there wasn''t so much noise.  Did you try running it thru something like neat image?  Maybe go back and shoot it just a bit earlier in the day to bring out more details. If you go back, try standing in different places and see if you can move the angel into the frame more.</td>', 'This would have a lot more impact if there wasn''t so much noise.  Did you try running it thru something like neat image?  Maybe go back and shoot it just a bit earlier in the day to bring out more details. If you go back, try standing in different places and see if you can move the angel into the frame more.', '2003-09-25 19:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(430819, 39321, 8860, '<td valign="top">Truthfully, I feel that it''s unfair to ask people to vote on this picture. It''s too heart-wrenching. That''s not to say that it doesn''t serve a purpose - it makes me very reflective and grateful for what I have.</td>', 'Truthfully, I feel that it''s unfair to ask people to vote on this picture. It''s too heart-wrenching. That''s not to say that it doesn''t serve a purpose - it makes me very reflective and grateful for what I have.', '2003-09-25 19:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
