(430880, 38421, 11738, '<td valign="top">Little guy really should be strapped in properly in booster seat.  That''s just dangerous.  Too much light coming from the back windshiled.  I do like the funky angle though.</td>', 'Little guy really should be strapped in properly in booster seat.  That''s just dangerous.  Too much light coming from the back windshiled.  I do like the funky angle though.', '2003-09-25 20:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(430885, 39113, 11738, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  A guaranteed ribbon in my book.  I commend your patience to take pictures of hummnigbirds.  Do you know what species?  Almost looks like a juvenile.  I love how branches in the foreground and background are very fuzzy.  Puts lots of emphasis on bird and dead branch.  Nice work!  Keep it up.</td>', 'I love this shot.  A guaranteed ribbon in my book.  I commend your patience to take pictures of hummnigbirds.  Do you know what species?  Almost looks like a juvenile.  I love how branches in the foreground and background are very fuzzy.  Puts lots of emphasis on bird and dead branch.  Nice work!  Keep it up.', '2003-09-25 20:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
