(431077, 39225, 11800, '<td valign="top">You really tried to capture a nice one.  Did you try getting more light on her?  With the quilt being light, my eye tends to focus more on it than the woman.  Also, IMHO, the frame detracts from the mood you have tried to create.  It''s like you put her picture on a button for strangers to wear.  Next time, try putting a light between your camera and her and if possible, put a medium colored quilt on the bed. Even with all that said, I gave you a 7 because I do like the mood.</td>', 'You really tried to capture a nice one.  Did you try getting more light on her?  With the quilt being light, my eye tends to focus more on it than the woman.  Also, IMHO, the frame detracts from the mood you have tried to create.  It''s like you put her picture on a button for strangers to wear.  Next time, try putting a light between your camera and her and if possible, put a medium colored quilt on the bed. Even with all that said, I gave you a 7 because I do like the mood.', '2003-09-25 23:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
