(431092, 38666, 11800, '<td valign="top">Looks like you applied too much neat image. You erased whatever personality the image might have had. The image itself makes me very sad.  Poor woman.</td>', 'Looks like you applied too much neat image. You erased whatever personality the image might have had. The image itself makes me very sad.  Poor woman.', '2003-09-25 23:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(431099, 39353, 11800, '<td valign="top">Painting with light is a really neat technique.  I don''t think it worked so well in this instance.  Try to previsualize what you are going to draw before you start and then follow that plan till you get what you imagined. The light in the background looks like an accident that hasn''t happened yet.</td>', 'Painting with light is a really neat technique.  I don''t think it worked so well in this instance.  Try to previsualize what you are going to draw before you start and then follow that plan till you get what you imagined. The light in the background looks like an accident that hasn''t happened yet.', '2003-09-25 23:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(431100, 39170, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details in the dog. Good use of b&amp;w. The great contrast helps to bring the dog to life. Shadows and reflections help to give the sense of furriness on the dog. "10"</td>', 'Beautiful details in the dog. Good use of b&w. The great contrast helps to bring the dog to life. Shadows and reflections help to give the sense of furriness on the dog. "10"', '2003-09-25 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(431101, 38198, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good closeup. Great big smile. The face really pops out of the image. Great details because of the good focusing.</td>', 'Good closeup. Great big smile. The face really pops out of the image. Great details because of the good focusing.', '2003-09-26 00:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(431102, 38479, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Good contrast between the two.  And the eye contact is great also. 9</td>', 'I like it.  Good contrast between the two.  And the eye contact is great also. 9', '2003-09-26 00:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(431106, 39221, 11800, '<td valign="top">Suppose you got a lot of this one, out of focus.  Also, there is too much light for the subject.  Light is supposed to kill him, yet he looks like he''s out in the midday sun.</td>', 'Suppose you got a lot of this one, out of focus.  Also, there is too much light for the subject.  Light is supposed to kill him, yet he looks like he''s out in the midday sun.', '2003-09-26 00:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(431115, 39236, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  Would you be able to explain it to me in the future?  Is it supposed to be someone who broke in and took a nap, a dead person that was left behind when the last tenant left, or what?</td>', 'I don''t get it.  Would you be able to explain it to me in the future?  Is it supposed to be someone who broke in and took a nap, a dead person that was left behind when the last tenant left, or what?', '2003-09-26 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(431129, 39151, 6477, '<td valign="top">I like the light in this picture, the subject is just perfect and the b/w works well for me here. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the light in this picture, the subject is just perfect and the b/w works well for me here. Good luck!', '2003-09-26 00:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(431141, 38637, 11800, '<td valign="top">An outstanding image.  I think the lines would have been enough to carry the idea without any color.  It is a kick to get to the bottom and see the blue triangle. I just don''t like the blues in the glass of water.  A wonderful 10. Hope this one wins.</td>', 'An outstanding image.  I think the lines would have been enough to carry the idea without any color.  It is a kick to get to the bottom and see the blue triangle. I just don''t like the blues in the glass of water.  A wonderful 10. Hope this one wins.', '2003-09-26 00:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(431147, 39183, 11126, '<td valign="top">What a catch! Character that is second to none here!</td>', 'What a catch! Character that is second to none here!', '2003-09-26 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(431148, 39148, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the pose here and think the similarity in fur color works well. The background is too distracting though</td>', 'I like the pose here and think the similarity in fur color works well. The background is too distracting though', '2003-09-26 00:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(431149, 39401, 11800, '<td valign="top">Umm. Your photo is upside down.  I love staged shots, but if the idea didn''t work right the first time, reshoot it till you get it right.  Or did you mean to have it upside down?  If you did, why?</td>', 'Umm. Your photo is upside down.  I love staged shots, but if the idea didn''t work right the first time, reshoot it till you get it right.  Or did you mean to have it upside down?  If you did, why?', '2003-09-26 00:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(431151, 38674, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice scene. could be improved by straightening the horizon and playing with the tonal range. I''d also crop out the bit of island on the right side</td>', 'nice scene. could be improved by straightening the horizon and playing with the tonal range. I''d also crop out the bit of island on the right side', '2003-09-26 00:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(431156, 38447, 8624, '<td valign="top">I almost passed this one by, but the more I study it, the more Ilike it. I especially like the way his leg mirrors the wooden step things. I think you could improve it by cropping out more of the fence area at the top, but it looks pretty nice and is well exposed.</td>', 'I almost passed this one by, but the more I study it, the more Ilike it. I especially like the way his leg mirrors the wooden step things. I think you could improve it by cropping out more of the fence area at the top, but it looks pretty nice and is well exposed.', '2003-09-26 01:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(431158, 38993, 6477, '<td valign="top">Great macro, excellent shot... congrats!</td>', 'Great macro, excellent shot... congrats!', '2003-09-26 01:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(431165, 39425, 11817, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2003-09-26 01:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(431166, 38229, 11817, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture</td>', 'Nice Picture', '2003-09-26 01:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(431168, 39196, 11800, '<td valign="top">The chaos on the board is good. The pipe and brandy would look better beside the board, where they would be if this was real game.  The pipe would at least be in an ashtray? Lighting is pretty good, maybe a little softer to preserve some texture in the highlight on the pipe and chess pieces and cut the glare off the glass.</td>', 'The chaos on the board is good. The pipe and brandy would look better beside the board, where they would be if this was real game.  The pipe would at least be in an ashtray? Lighting is pretty good, maybe a little softer to preserve some texture in the highlight on the pipe and chess pieces and cut the glare off the glass.', '2003-09-26 01:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(431169, 38200, 11817, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat.</td>', 'Beautiful cat.', '2003-09-26 01:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(431170, 38740, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the tight framing. good tones and good use of DOF. The sray hair across her face is a nice visual component.</td>', 'I like the tight framing. good tones and good use of DOF. The sray hair across her face is a nice visual component.', '2003-09-26 01:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(431171, 39171, 8624, '<td valign="top">clever take on the theme</td>', 'clever take on the theme', '2003-09-26 01:13:40.000000', NULL, 1);
