(431278, 39090, 8522, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed for my taste. I also don''t see anything placed, seated, or lying. 3</td>', 'A little overexposed for my taste. I also don''t see anything placed, seated, or lying. 3', '2003-09-26 04:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(431287, 39097, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over-sharpened for a portrait of a woman. In particular, it is not flattering to the hair and makes it look frizzy. Other than that, great shot. Nice composition. 7</td>', 'Looks a little over-sharpened for a portrait of a woman. In particular, it is not flattering to the hair and makes it look frizzy. Other than that, great shot. Nice composition. 7', '2003-09-26 04:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(431288, 39420, 8522, '<td valign="top">Amazing high-key portrait... the face tones are perfectly exposed, and yet the rest of the photo is so high-key. You''ve captured a great expression in your subject, and a great pose. Effective composition and crop. 10</td>', 'Amazing high-key portrait... the face tones are perfectly exposed, and yet the rest of the photo is so high-key. You''ve captured a great expression in your subject, and a great pose. Effective composition and crop. 10', '2003-09-26 04:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(431289, 39070, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Highlights the subjects perfectly. Love the dark shadows in the shot.  Cool shiny reflections on the chair and the guy sitting. "10"</td>', 'Great lighting. Highlights the subjects perfectly. Love the dark shadows in the shot.  Cool shiny reflections on the chair and the guy sitting. "10"', '2003-09-26 04:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(431290, 39142, 8522, '<td valign="top">I had a quick look at this one in Photoshop, and you really need to do some post-processing on this one. You''re not using any of the lighter tones here, and you really need to increase your contrast once you''ve adjusted your levels. A gamma correction helps as well. Once all that has been done, it''s a good picture! 4</td>', 'I had a quick look at this one in Photoshop, and you really need to do some post-processing on this one. You''re not using any of the lighter tones here, and you really need to increase your contrast once you''ve adjusted your levels. A gamma correction helps as well. Once all that has been done, it''s a good picture! 4', '2003-09-26 04:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(431292, 39391, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great close up. You can see the fuzziness of the tennis ball. Very vivid shadow on the court. You can almost feel the texture of the floor. Composition is good and interesting. "9"</td>', 'Great close up. You can see the fuzziness of the tennis ball. Very vivid shadow on the court. You can almost feel the texture of the floor. Composition is good and interesting. "9"', '2003-09-26 04:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(431293, 38198, 8522, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see calm here! 3</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see calm here! 3', '2003-09-26 04:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(431295, 39225, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photograph is underexposed, but the real problem is with that obtrusive 3d bevel border thing. WHY? 3</td>', 'Photograph is underexposed, but the real problem is with that obtrusive 3d bevel border thing. WHY? 3', '2003-09-26 04:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(431298, 39401, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot... shame you didn''t adjust the white balance though. I reckon this would have been better without the orange colour cast. 6</td>', 'Great shot... shame you didn''t adjust the white balance though. I reckon this would have been better without the orange colour cast. 6', '2003-09-26 04:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(431299, 39174, 6172, '<td valign="top">There''s a ton of calm in this shot...</td>', 'There''s a ton of calm in this shot...', '2003-09-26 04:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
