(431302, 39161, 6172, '<td valign="top">This girl does not look very calm, and she certainly doesn''t make me feel calm.  However, there is room for interpetation in this challenge, I wouldn''t say this "doesn''t meet the challenge", just that it''s a stretch (and a rather beautiful one).</td>', 'This girl does not look very calm, and she certainly doesn''t make me feel calm.  However, there is room for interpetation in this challenge, I wouldn''t say this "doesn''t meet the challenge", just that it''s a stretch (and a rather beautiful one).', '2003-09-26 05:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
