(431550, 39315, 6888, '<td valign="top">there is just something about this photo that I like but I can''t seem to really express what it is...I keep coming back to look at it...it is very nice and peacefull</td>', 'there is just something about this photo that I like but I can''t seem to really express what it is...I keep coming back to look at it...it is very nice and peacefull', '2003-09-26 13:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
