(431652, 39315, 10752, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! This pic has a very good dynamic range and the composition is very well-balanced.</td>', 'Very nice shot! This pic has a very good dynamic range and the composition is very well-balanced.', '2003-09-26 14:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(431654, 39423, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice photo, wonderful closeup of this bird....good color and clarity</td>', 'nice photo, wonderful closeup of this bird....good color and clarity', '2003-09-26 15:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(431655, 38765, 10752, '<td valign="top">Very - very nice photo!!! Great momente also the dripping on the water. Congratulations!!! 10!</td>', 'Very - very nice photo!!! Great momente also the dripping on the water. Congratulations!!! 10!', '2003-09-26 15:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(431656, 38661, 9441, '<td valign="top">precious photo, just a bit hazy...I wish it had been clearer and sharper..nice capture, though</td>', 'precious photo, just a bit hazy...I wish it had been clearer and sharper..nice capture, though', '2003-09-26 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(431658, 38916, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture of him at rest...nice level at which this was shot...</td>', 'wonderful capture of him at rest...nice level at which this was shot...', '2003-09-26 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(431660, 38932, 9441, '<td valign="top">vivid color, clear photo...nice....</td>', 'vivid color, clear photo...nice....', '2003-09-26 15:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(431661, 38264, 10752, '<td valign="top">The moment is great! This is a real concept of the photographer that means "I catch the instant". Congratulations! 10!</td>', 'The moment is great! This is a real concept of the photographer that means "I catch the instant". Congratulations! 10!', '2003-09-26 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(431663, 38479, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice photo, just slightly grainy, but a good photo just the same...I like the tint</td>', 'nice photo, just slightly grainy, but a good photo just the same...I like the tint', '2003-09-26 15:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(431664, 39305, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite, and not just because it has no cats in it.  It has a great feeling of calm, the colors are wonderful the graininess adds to the oriental mediative feel,  The composition is well crafted, I especially like the leading line of the flowere stem which takes me back and forth from the light on the flower to the mysterious light that seems to be coming from inside the vase.  the rogh vase on the right adds some weight to the image and seems to keep the flower from tipping over.  Lovely 10</td>', 'This is my favorite, and not just because it has no cats in it.  It has a great feeling of calm, the colors are wonderful the graininess adds to the oriental mediative feel,  The composition is well crafted, I especially like the leading line of the flowere stem which takes me back and forth from the light on the flower to the mysterious light that seems to be coming from inside the vase.  the rogh vase on the right adds some weight to the image and seems to keep the flower from tipping over.  Lovely 10', '2003-09-26 15:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(431666, 39141, 10752, '<td valign="top">The synthesis of the photo is really outstanding. Sepia is the appropriate way for this shot. Congratulations! 9!</td>', 'The synthesis of the photo is really outstanding. Sepia is the appropriate way for this shot. Congratulations! 9!', '2003-09-26 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(431670, 38401, 10260, '<td valign="top">A nice head shot, but I guess I''m dense.  I can''t see how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'A nice head shot, but I guess I''m dense.  I can''t see how this fits the challenge.', '2003-09-26 15:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(431681, 38290, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Can''t decide whether I like the effect or not but since it''s undecided that''s not an immediate no! I do like the composition/ position.</td>', 'Interesting image. Can''t decide whether I like the effect or not but since it''s undecided that''s not an immediate no! I do like the composition/ position.', '2003-09-26 15:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(431683, 39110, 3087, '<td valign="top">Perfectly acceptable pet photo but doesnt _wow_ as an image in it\''s own right. Would I buy this for my wall/ as a postcard etc if I saw it outside of this challenge? Probably not. Cat looks awfully familiar though? But if it\''s the cat I know I\''m wondering why the head isn\''t upside down tucked half under... :D</td>', 'Perfectly acceptable pet photo but doesnt _wow_ as an image in it\''s own right. Would I buy this for my wall/ as a postcard etc if I saw it outside of this challenge? Probably not. Cat looks awfully familiar though? But if it\''s the cat I know I\''m wondering why the head isn\''t upside down tucked half under... :D', '2003-09-26 15:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(431684, 39400, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual perspective and composition. Lighting lets it down for me. Although I like the idea of some empty space I''m not sure the impact of that wall adds anything on this occasion.</td>', 'Unusual perspective and composition. Lighting lets it down for me. Although I like the idea of some empty space I''m not sure the impact of that wall adds anything on this occasion.', '2003-09-26 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(431686, 39398, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of the nicer pet shots - beautiful composition, nice backgrounds (with interesting, complimentary colours and texture). Lighting a little harsh.</td>', 'One of the nicer pet shots - beautiful composition, nice backgrounds (with interesting, complimentary colours and texture). Lighting a little harsh.', '2003-09-26 15:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(431687, 39127, 3087, '<td valign="top">First thing I''d do is lose the top inch and have only water as the backdrop. Image quality doesn''t seem that good. Photo does convey restful nap but isn''t hugely interesting to me - a nice image but not one I''d want to buy/ display.</td>', 'First thing I''d do is lose the top inch and have only water as the backdrop. Image quality doesn''t seem that good. Photo does convey restful nap but isn''t hugely interesting to me - a nice image but not one I''d want to buy/ display.', '2003-09-26 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(431690, 39196, 3087, '<td valign="top">Much too cluttered (for my tastes) to be restful though it does convey hobbies/ pastimes. Interesting reflection of board within glass. Seems very soft, and not in a way that enhances the image (for me).</td>', 'Much too cluttered (for my tastes) to be restful though it does convey hobbies/ pastimes. Interesting reflection of board within glass. Seems very soft, and not in a way that enhances the image (for me).', '2003-09-26 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(431691, 39303, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh this is nice. I like the softness very much in this image - it makes things almost luminescent and very dreamlike. Very surreal in feeling, very artistic and creative, I can see this in a gallery, I would buy this on a postcard to send to an arty bookworm friend of mine. (Don''t mean on DPC Prints where I''d be paying through nose for postage but I mean if I saw it in a local store).</td>', 'Oooh this is nice. I like the softness very much in this image - it makes things almost luminescent and very dreamlike. Very surreal in feeling, very artistic and creative, I can see this in a gallery, I would buy this on a postcard to send to an arty bookworm friend of mine. (Don''t mean on DPC Prints where I''d be paying through nose for postage but I mean if I saw it in a local store).', '2003-09-26 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(431693, 38235, 3087, '<td valign="top">Holds my interest in some ways, I like the stark nature, but the unnatural colour cast doesn''t work well for me.</td>', 'Holds my interest in some ways, I like the stark nature, but the unnatural colour cast doesn''t work well for me.', '2003-09-26 15:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(431694, 39313, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the central character but the endroit is somewhat dull and makes for a fussy background. I appreciate that this may be meant as a contrast to his relaxation but I dont like it. Also find shadows too dark on main subject, though overal range of tones seems good.</td>', 'I like the central character but the endroit is somewhat dull and makes for a fussy background. I appreciate that this may be meant as a contrast to his relaxation but I dont like it. Also find shadows too dark on main subject, though overal range of tones seems good.', '2003-09-26 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(431695, 38440, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Nicely composed. Is it a cabbage patch doll or something similar? Image is cool and colour choices are also, but image quality seems very poor.</td>', 'Sweet! Nicely composed. Is it a cabbage patch doll or something similar? Image is cool and colour choices are also, but image quality seems very poor.', '2003-09-26 15:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(431698, 39213, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice candid! I can see it in a relaxed guide book or as part of a travel related series of images. I like it in that context.</td>', 'Nice candid! I can see it in a relaxed guide book or as part of a travel related series of images. I like it in that context.', '2003-09-26 15:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(431699, 39355, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice. Very unusual perspective and makes a mundane event seem somehow exciting, possibly sinister or erotic, and certainly enigmatic. Lighting and motion capture are excellent for this style. I like the colourisation choice.</td>', 'Nice. Very unusual perspective and makes a mundane event seem somehow exciting, possibly sinister or erotic, and certainly enigmatic. Lighting and motion capture are excellent for this style. I like the colourisation choice.', '2003-09-26 15:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(431700, 39194, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Tones seem a bit drab.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Tones seem a bit drab.', '2003-09-26 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(431701, 38801, 3087, '<td valign="top">Through rose tinted spectacles? Interesting, perhaps a touch too much colour saturation? I like the image, particularly the haze in the background.</td>', 'Through rose tinted spectacles? Interesting, perhaps a touch too much colour saturation? I like the image, particularly the haze in the background.', '2003-09-26 15:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(431704, 38656, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice! Shame the trees/ hill behind mean that one cant see silhouettes for all the birds in the row. Would moving around at all have helped with that? I like the image but more for the potential of what is almost a superb image.</td>', 'Nice! Shame the trees/ hill behind mean that one cant see silhouettes for all the birds in the row. Would moving around at all have helped with that? I like the image but more for the potential of what is almost a superb image.', '2003-09-26 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(431705, 38367, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the extraneous background helps. I''d prefer this if it were cropped nice and close to mum and baby, in a portrait orientation.</td>', 'I don''t think the extraneous background helps. I''d prefer this if it were cropped nice and close to mum and baby, in a portrait orientation.', '2003-09-26 15:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(431706, 39169, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the way the colout of the clothing reflects the colours of the step, doors and wall.  Nice composition, simple. Interesting.</td>', 'Love the way the colout of the clothing reflects the colours of the step, doors and wall.  Nice composition, simple. Interesting.', '2003-09-26 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(431709, 39198, 3087, '<td valign="top">I feel that this needs a touch less cropping at the lower edge - the fingers are cropped so short that one has to look before they come into focus for what they are - they are a little too abbreviated for immediate visualisation of the pose. If that doesn''t make sense, PM me. Lighting (and shadow areas) are great. Neg- space on the right well used.</td>', 'I feel that this needs a touch less cropping at the lower edge - the fingers are cropped so short that one has to look before they come into focus for what they are - they are a little too abbreviated for immediate visualisation of the pose. If that doesn''t make sense, PM me. Lighting (and shadow areas) are great. Neg- space on the right well used.', '2003-09-26 15:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(431710, 39220, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice close crop. Good lighting. Nice expressions. A lovely image and more than just a family snapshot.</td>', 'Nice close crop. Good lighting. Nice expressions. A lovely image and more than just a family snapshot.', '2003-09-26 15:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(431711, 38301, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the choice to hide her eyes a lot. Quirky and works well here. Not sure about green colour cast at all though.</td>', 'Like the choice to hide her eyes a lot. Quirky and works well here. Not sure about green colour cast at all though.', '2003-09-26 15:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(431712, 39068, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, unusual lighting, good use of shadow to balance the light. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Nice composition, unusual lighting, good use of shadow to balance the light. I like it a lot.', '2003-09-26 15:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(431714, 38264, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Composition doesn''t quite feel balanced to me - I feel I want to just play around (on a minor level) with cropping in order to move the leaf around a touch. I do like this a lot.</td>', 'Lovely. Composition doesn''t quite feel balanced to me - I feel I want to just play around (on a minor level) with cropping in order to move the leaf around a touch. I do like this a lot.', '2003-09-26 15:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(431715, 39404, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like how it''s almost a silhoette but not quite. Framing really puts her in a box though so doesn''t quite feel as free and peaceful as it might were the subject not hemmed in in this way.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like how it''s almost a silhoette but not quite. Framing really puts her in a box though so doesn''t quite feel as free and peaceful as it might were the subject not hemmed in in this way.', '2003-09-26 15:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(431716, 39369, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stunning. This succeeds for me because it allows me to place my own story/ dreams into it. Love the content and the colours. Composition isn''t spot on for me, though the content is strong enough that it''s still wonderful but I''m curious as to whether you took any others of different compositions in same place?</td>', 'Stunning. This succeeds for me because it allows me to place my own story/ dreams into it. Love the content and the colours. Composition isn''t spot on for me, though the content is strong enough that it''s still wonderful but I''m curious as to whether you took any others of different compositions in same place?', '2003-09-26 16:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(431717, 39177, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! A story, great colour, unusual but strong composition. I think this is superb!</td>', 'Wonderful! A story, great colour, unusual but strong composition. I think this is superb!', '2003-09-26 16:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(431718, 39311, 12603, '<td valign="top">what a cutie.</td>', 'what a cutie.', '2003-09-26 16:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(431728, 38464, 9295, '<td valign="top">I want to let you know that the low score I gave you on this was not because of the subject matter (although it does not at all appeal to me) but because your execution (uh...pun not intended. LOL) of the shot isn''t very interesting. I think it might have come across a bit more artistic had you chosen black and white over color, since the teal of the ground is very uncomplimentary to the green of the foliage behind the cat.  I like the DOF fine.</td>', 'I want to let you know that the low score I gave you on this was not because of the subject matter (although it does not at all appeal to me) but because your execution (uh...pun not intended. LOL) of the shot isn''t very interesting. I think it might have come across a bit more artistic had you chosen black and white over color, since the teal of the ground is very uncomplimentary to the green of the foliage behind the cat.  I like the DOF fine.', '2003-09-26 16:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(431731, 39160, 9295, '<td valign="top">This just isn''t a very interesting shot to me.  Your lighting does little to enhance your subject and there is nothing about the placement on the page, the backdrop or the corks themselves that give me much reason to linger on the photo.  I guess I can see your angle in fitting it within the theme of the challenge, but it doesn''t quite work.</td>', 'This just isn''t a very interesting shot to me.  Your lighting does little to enhance your subject and there is nothing about the placement on the page, the backdrop or the corks themselves that give me much reason to linger on the photo.  I guess I can see your angle in fitting it within the theme of the challenge, but it doesn''t quite work.', '2003-09-26 16:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(431734, 38198, 9295, '<td valign="top">Despite not conveying the Rest theme to me, this picture is is somewhat lacking in appeal for me.  The hard straight shadow on the right is distracting as are the automobiles in the background.  It comes across as little more than a snapshot of a child mugging for the camera--appealing to a parent or someone close to the child, but to a wider audience, there is not much to look at here.</td>', 'Despite not conveying the Rest theme to me, this picture is is somewhat lacking in appeal for me.  The hard straight shadow on the right is distracting as are the automobiles in the background.  It comes across as little more than a snapshot of a child mugging for the camera--appealing to a parent or someone close to the child, but to a wider audience, there is not much to look at here.', '2003-09-26 16:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(431736, 39177, 9982, '<td valign="top">Is that McDonald\''s cup meant to be ironic?<br/> <br/>[8]</td>', 'Is that McDonald\''s cup meant to be ironic? [8]', '2003-09-26 16:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(431739, 39367, 9295, '<td valign="top">You must be a guy--a woman would NEVER leave the seat up! LOL  Anyway, you might be right about this being the most restful spot in the house, but to make it a challenge-worthy photo, it needs to be cleaned up and better lit to give it more appeal than just being a snapshot of a toilet.  Your lighting gives it a less-than clean feel--not a very tasteful thought and I think your camera or resizing process distorted the lines, especially on the lid and around the chrome plumbing.  I do like the hint of gold on the wall as well as the tissue box being the only color in the room. I nice attempt at humor, but could be better executed.</td>', 'You must be a guy--a woman would NEVER leave the seat up! LOL  Anyway, you might be right about this being the most restful spot in the house, but to make it a challenge-worthy photo, it needs to be cleaned up and better lit to give it more appeal than just being a snapshot of a toilet.  Your lighting gives it a less-than clean feel--not a very tasteful thought and I think your camera or resizing process distorted the lines, especially on the lid and around the chrome plumbing.  I do like the hint of gold on the wall as well as the tissue box being the only color in the room. I nice attempt at humor, but could be better executed.', '2003-09-26 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(431742, 39370, 9437, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo of subject; however, the bright green leaf in the background is distracting. It pulls the eye past your subject.</td>', 'Excellent photo of subject; however, the bright green leaf in the background is distracting. It pulls the eye past your subject.', '2003-09-26 16:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(431748, 39219, 9295, '<td valign="top">I appreciate your attempt at being creative with this, but I don''t think the result comes across quite as you hoped.  To be perfectly honest, being a negative forces the eye to zero in on elements that one would not normally want one''s eye drawn upon (such as the insides of nostrils and underarm hair). It is an interesting idea combining traditional photography with digital, I''m afraid I just don''t care much for it.</td>', 'I appreciate your attempt at being creative with this, but I don''t think the result comes across quite as you hoped.  To be perfectly honest, being a negative forces the eye to zero in on elements that one would not normally want one''s eye drawn upon (such as the insides of nostrils and underarm hair). It is an interesting idea combining traditional photography with digital, I''m afraid I just don''t care much for it.', '2003-09-26 16:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(431749, 39401, 3569, '<td valign="top">Kind of presented wrong...I think?</td>', 'Kind of presented wrong...I think?', '2003-09-26 16:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
