(431980, 39245, 6504, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting.  The black background is perfect to highlight the white fur.<br/>The textures in the blanket and the softness of the fur is a good combination.</td>', 'Excellent lighting.  The black background is perfect to highlight the white fur.The textures in the blanket and the softness of the fur is a good combination.', '2003-09-26 21:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
