(431983, 38664, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat and such perfect clarity.  The detail is amazing.   I like the simplicity of the picture.  Of course you could get the whole ear in the picture, but you probably would have lost the closeness of it.</td>', 'Beautiful cat and such perfect clarity.  The detail is amazing.   I like the simplicity of the picture.  Of course you could get the whole ear in the picture, but you probably would have lost the closeness of it.', '2003-09-26 21:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(431984, 39138, 8624, '<td valign="top">normally I would complain about tonal range here, with the shot being too gray, but in this case, I think it helps the shot and adds mood. There is a dreamy quality to this shot that I like. I''m rating it lower than I think it merits, however, because the bright spot on the ice on the right really annoys me and breaks the mood. I think, had this shot been cropped to remove that flaw, this would have been one of the better images in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'normally I would complain about tonal range here, with the shot being too gray, but in this case, I think it helps the shot and adds mood. There is a dreamy quality to this shot that I like. I''m rating it lower than I think it merits, however, because the bright spot on the ice on the right really annoys me and breaks the mood. I think, had this shot been cropped to remove that flaw, this would have been one of the better images in the challenge.', '2003-09-26 21:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(431985, 39370, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice macro but I wish the background wasn''t so cluttered.</td>', 'nice macro but I wish the background wasn''t so cluttered.', '2003-09-26 21:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(431986, 39304, 8624, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the noise in the shot and the framing seems unbalanced. The duck''s head is too close to the top of the frame.</td>', 'I don''t care for the noise in the shot and the framing seems unbalanced. The duck''s head is too close to the top of the frame.', '2003-09-26 21:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(431988, 38794, 8624, '<td valign="top">Kudos for coming up with a more imaginative pose and setting for a resting dog than did many others. I like the way you framed the dog and I like the monchrome choice. It look too red to me, but I''m colorblind, so take that with a grain of salt if it isn''t red, but more sepia.<br/></td>', 'Kudos for coming up with a more imaginative pose and setting for a resting dog than did many others. I like the way you framed the dog and I like the monchrome choice. It look too red to me, but I''m colorblind, so take that with a grain of salt if it isn''t red, but more sepia.', '2003-09-26 21:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(431989, 39408, 8624, '<td valign="top">would have been more interesting without the cluttered background. I don''t think a natural, outdoor setting is important to focus on when you could have filled the frame with the tools.</td>', 'would have been more interesting without the cluttered background. I don''t think a natural, outdoor setting is important to focus on when you could have filled the frame with the tools.', '2003-09-26 21:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(431990, 39422, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the tight cropping but not the color choice here. It leaves me cold. a gentle sleeping baby should give a warmer feeling. There are nice abstract qualities to the baby''s face established by zooming in so close and I think you''ve captured them well, but that color cast hurts the shot for me.</td>', 'I like the tight cropping but not the color choice here. It leaves me cold. a gentle sleeping baby should give a warmer feeling. There are nice abstract qualities to the baby''s face established by zooming in so close and I think you''ve captured them well, but that color cast hurts the shot for me.', '2003-09-26 21:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(431993, 39176, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the pose with the ears flopping over at a jaunty angle and the relaxed look of the legs crossed. The right arm outstretched looks like he is inviting companionship. nice job making an inanimate object look relaxed and rested. I don''t care for your choice of frame - I think a simple white border or no border would have worked better - just a comment. I don''t vote on the frame, but it does hurt the image.</td>', 'I like the pose with the ears flopping over at a jaunty angle and the relaxed look of the legs crossed. The right arm outstretched looks like he is inviting companionship. nice job making an inanimate object look relaxed and rested. I don''t care for your choice of frame - I think a simple white border or no border would have worked better - just a comment. I don''t vote on the frame, but it does hurt the image.', '2003-09-26 21:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(431995, 39070, 8624, '<td valign="top">clever and different. I like the composition but not the lighting. The shadows are very harsh and a significant portion of the frame at the top is in shadow. I think this could work when setting a different mood, but it doesn''t do it for me here.</td>', 'clever and different. I like the composition but not the lighting. The shadows are very harsh and a significant portion of the frame at the top is in shadow. I think this could work when setting a different mood, but it doesn''t do it for me here.', '2003-09-26 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(431999, 39204, 5086, '<td valign="top">i would have liked the picture better if you hadn''t cropped the string.  The gyroscope at rest concept is a novel one.  I like it...</td>', 'i would have liked the picture better if you hadn''t cropped the string.  The gyroscope at rest concept is a novel one.  I like it...', '2003-09-26 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(432000, 38661, 8624, '<td valign="top">cute puppy, but the focus is soft, the lighting is flat, tones are too gray and the overall composition is relatively dull. Don''t take this too harshly, just go out and take more shots of him to work on your technique. I recommend shotting lots - I regret not having done that with my dog. He was so small for such a short time and now is a 90 lb monster.</td>', 'cute puppy, but the focus is soft, the lighting is flat, tones are too gray and the overall composition is relatively dull. Don''t take this too harshly, just go out and take more shots of him to work on your technique. I recommend shotting lots - I regret not having done that with my dog. He was so small for such a short time and now is a 90 lb monster.', '2003-09-26 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(432002, 39401, 8624, '<td valign="top">flipping the image 180 degrees was a creative choice. I think the shot could have been improved by cropping the bottom of the frame (the top of the starirs) where the computer monitor is.</td>', 'flipping the image 180 degrees was a creative choice. I think the shot could have been improved by cropping the bottom of the frame (the top of the starirs) where the computer monitor is.', '2003-09-26 21:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(432004, 39247, 5086, '<td valign="top">good picture but i don''t feel it meets the challenge of ''at rest''...</td>', 'good picture but i don''t feel it meets the challenge of ''at rest''...', '2003-09-26 21:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(432006, 39403, 5086, '<td valign="top">interesting manipulation...</td>', 'interesting manipulation...', '2003-09-26 21:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(432009, 39111, 5086, '<td valign="top">very interesting...  what is the story?  a window washer on a sky scraper?</td>', 'very interesting...  what is the story?  a window washer on a sky scraper?', '2003-09-26 21:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(432010, 38993, 5086, '<td valign="top">lovely picture, but i can''t see a relationship to ''at rest''...</td>', 'lovely picture, but i can''t see a relationship to ''at rest''...', '2003-09-26 21:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(432013, 38212, 8624, '<td valign="top">this shot has some nice elements to it, even if they are somewhat cliche. I like the way the sun radiates from the center of the top of the mast and the way the man is in partial silouette. I wish he was more off to the side and not occluding the boat. I also don''t care for the flare on his back.</td>', 'this shot has some nice elements to it, even if they are somewhat cliche. I like the way the sun radiates from the center of the top of the mast and the way the man is in partial silouette. I wish he was more off to the side and not occluding the boat. I also don''t care for the flare on his back.', '2003-09-26 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(432014, 38664, 12330, '<td valign="top">very clean shot</td>', 'very clean shot', '2003-09-26 21:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(432017, 38801, 5086, '<td valign="top">beautiful...</td>', 'beautiful...', '2003-09-26 21:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(432018, 39115, 5086, '<td valign="top">happy, but not ''at rest''...<br/></td>', 'happy, but not ''at rest''...', '2003-09-26 21:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(432021, 39236, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the wide shot here, reducing the subject to something smaller. The plain sterile setting is interesting since it seems to be anything but restful for the subject, indictaing to me that she''s having a fitful rest. I like the natural lighting, but it''s pretty harshly overexposed on the right.</td>', 'I like the wide shot here, reducing the subject to something smaller. The plain sterile setting is interesting since it seems to be anything but restful for the subject, indictaing to me that she''s having a fitful rest. I like the natural lighting, but it''s pretty harshly overexposed on the right.', '2003-09-26 21:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(432022, 39216, 12330, '<td valign="top">very good shot, something tells me though that there is something more behind this than just being tired. there is somekind of sadness over this photo, makes me wonder a litle bit. this photo tells a story. I think it should have been croped a litle bit more on the left and right side.</td>', 'very good shot, something tells me though that there is something more behind this than just being tired. there is somekind of sadness over this photo, makes me wonder a litle bit. this photo tells a story. I think it should have been croped a litle bit more on the left and right side.', '2003-09-26 21:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(432024, 39355, 12330, '<td valign="top">very stylish shoot. Like the blue color on it and that litle movement on the subject.</td>', 'very stylish shoot. Like the blue color on it and that litle movement on the subject.', '2003-09-26 22:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(432027, 39333, 11495, '<td valign="top">What do you think about changing subject of your photos? In the last shot, the wood man has got a ball between hands.... or not?</td>', 'What do you think about changing subject of your photos? In the last shot, the wood man has got a ball between hands.... or not?', '2003-09-26 22:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
