(432042, 39212, 10040, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  I am not sure that the horizontal format best suits this picture.  I would have liked to see it vertical.</td>', 'I like the shot.  I am not sure that the horizontal format best suits this picture.  I would have liked to see it vertical.', '2003-09-26 22:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(432044, 39111, 8229, '<td valign="top">interesting!</td>', 'interesting!', '2003-09-26 22:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(432045, 39308, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Although I like the angel in the foreground, I don''t like the way she is partially cropped out.  The angle chosen for the crosses is awesome.  I think it may have been better to focus on just the crosses, the sky, and the background and eliminating the foreground things.  Technically speaking, the photo seems very dark and there is an awful lot of "noise".</td>', 'Nice concept.  Although I like the angel in the foreground, I don''t like the way she is partially cropped out.  The angle chosen for the crosses is awesome.  I think it may have been better to focus on just the crosses, the sky, and the background and eliminating the foreground things.  Technically speaking, the photo seems very dark and there is an awful lot of "noise".', '2003-09-26 22:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(432046, 38916, 8229, '<td valign="top">that is such a neat shot!!</td>', 'that is such a neat shot!!', '2003-09-26 22:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
