(432692, 39015, 11508, '<td valign="top">Oh my. . . I like the angle you chose to photograph the truck at. The guys on the side also fit in nicely.</td>', 'Oh my. . . I like the angle you chose to photograph the truck at. The guys on the side also fit in nicely.', '2003-09-27 20:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(432697, 38464, 11508, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph for a number of reasons. I''m not sure if its intentional, but I really like how the ground and the plants in background are brightly colored blues and greens, and how the cat and the mouse are more muted earthy brown and black tones. I also like how focused the mouse is. and how forlorn the dead mouse is. overall, great.</td>', 'I really like this photograph for a number of reasons. I''m not sure if its intentional, but I really like how the ground and the plants in background are brightly colored blues and greens, and how the cat and the mouse are more muted earthy brown and black tones. I also like how focused the mouse is. and how forlorn the dead mouse is. overall, great.', '2003-09-27 20:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(432712, 38688, 11495, '<td valign="top">I congrats to you about difficult shot! Good quality but bad light... it''s too low..</td>', 'I congrats to you about difficult shot! Good quality but bad light... it''s too low..', '2003-09-27 21:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(432723, 38367, 2333, '<td valign="top">Good concept, like the light. Don''t care for the floor covering. Need to compress less, there are JPEG compression artifacts that are noticeable. Your file size is only 28k, you should try for nearer to the 150k size limit.</td>', 'Good concept, like the light. Don''t care for the floor covering. Need to compress less, there are JPEG compression artifacts that are noticeable. Your file size is only 28k, you should try for nearer to the 150k size limit.', '2003-09-27 21:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(432762, 39177, 11570, '<td valign="top">A nice photo with a good feeling of peace and quiet but the composition is spolied by what looks like a MacDonalds cup on the right hand side.  Not least because the red in it draws the eye.</td>', 'A nice photo with a good feeling of peace and quiet but the composition is spolied by what looks like a MacDonalds cup on the right hand side.  Not least because the red in it draws the eye.', '2003-09-27 22:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(432765, 38732, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and nice composition, but I find that the sky looks weird, as if its pixelated.  Alomst looks like the clouds were manually removed.  I''m not saying that you did this, but it does look weird.  I also find that the focus isn''t quite crisp enough.</td>', 'Nice idea and nice composition, but I find that the sky looks weird, as if its pixelated.  Alomst looks like the clouds were manually removed.  I''m not saying that you did this, but it does look weird.  I also find that the focus isn''t quite crisp enough.', '2003-09-27 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
