(433314, 39401, 4585, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  But it seems counter-intutive to look at.  From whose perspective is the viewer looking at this from?  Viewers might get confused and down point it.  I will overlook that but cannot overlook the white balance issue.  Too red/orange.  GL.</td>', 'Excellent idea.  But it seems counter-intutive to look at.  From whose perspective is the viewer looking at this from?  Viewers might get confused and down point it.  I will overlook that but cannot overlook the white balance issue.  Too red/orange.  GL.', '2003-09-28 21:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
