(433394, 39020, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good composition, background, and focus. The model''s expression is great. The lighting isn''t; you probably did the best you could under the conditions, but the bright spots and shadows on her face are really distracting.</td>', 'Good composition, background, and focus. The model''s expression is great. The lighting isn''t; you probably did the best you could under the conditions, but the bright spots and shadows on her face are really distracting.', '2003-09-28 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
