(433399, 38212, 10402, '<td valign="top">The juxtaposition of the boat mast and the sun is great, as are the colors and reflection. I wish the man wasn''t there; he doesn''t really add anything.</td>', 'The juxtaposition of the boat mast and the sun is great, as are the colors and reflection. I wish the man wasn''t there; he doesn''t really add anything.', '2003-09-28 23:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(433408, 39173, 10402, '<td valign="top">Most of the lines in this photo lead the viewer''s eye to the knitting, which is the only thing in focus so is definitely the center of interest. There is enough focus in the background for it to tell the story. The lighting and color cast are effective. Great photo.</td>', 'Most of the lines in this photo lead the viewer''s eye to the knitting, which is the only thing in focus so is definitely the center of interest. There is enough focus in the background for it to tell the story. The lighting and color cast are effective. Great photo.', '2003-09-28 23:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(433417, 39403, 10402, '<td valign="top">The setting, his pose, and especially his removed shoes make this photo tell a story. A bit blurry and has more contrast than I like.</td>', 'The setting, his pose, and especially his removed shoes make this photo tell a story. A bit blurry and has more contrast than I like.', '2003-09-28 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(433427, 39317, 806, '<td valign="top">this is a great silouette! the lighting perfectly cast just enough shadow, yet still highlights the book, foot, body and hand of the child (?). I especially love the glint in the eye. It evokes a feeling that the reader is captivated by the story - the expression continues in the hint of "wow" in the mouth.<br/>Nice job!</td>', 'this is a great silouette! the lighting perfectly cast just enough shadow, yet still highlights the book, foot, body and hand of the child (?). I especially love the glint in the eye. It evokes a feeling that the reader is captivated by the story - the expression continues in the hint of "wow" in the mouth.Nice job!', '2003-09-28 23:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(433435, 38301, 11457, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite shot for this challenge. I just love the light, the colors and the composition. Makes me curious. Nice work!</td>', 'This is my favourite shot for this challenge. I just love the light, the colors and the composition. Makes me curious. Nice work!', '2003-09-29 00:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
