(433654, 39415, 9027, '<td valign="top">funny idea (love the glittery ears), but the lighting is too direct and uninteresting.</td>', 'funny idea (love the glittery ears), but the lighting is too direct and uninteresting.', '2003-09-29 02:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
