(433664, 38350, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the colors here. nice soft/warm. would be nice if the whole left side/corner was not so cropped, cutting off the rest of the cat.</td>', 'i like the colors here. nice soft/warm. would be nice if the whole left side/corner was not so cropped, cutting off the rest of the cat.', '2003-09-29 02:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(433665, 38206, 9027, '<td valign="top">i think this shot would be more effective is you could have zoomed in to get closer to the subject. either that, or have a larger image. (looks like he wasn''t working anyway, but watching tv!)</td>', 'i think this shot would be more effective is you could have zoomed in to get closer to the subject. either that, or have a larger image. (looks like he wasn''t working anyway, but watching tv!)', '2003-09-29 02:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(433668, 39370, 9027, '<td valign="top">the sunlight is really harsh. kinda flattens the image, making it hard to distinguish between foreground and background, even with the dof. that grasshopper looks so menacing!! yikes. doesn''t look like he''s resting, looks  like he''s ready to pounce any second. 0_o</td>', 'the sunlight is really harsh. kinda flattens the image, making it hard to distinguish between foreground and background, even with the dof. that grasshopper looks so menacing!! yikes. doesn''t look like he''s resting, looks  like he''s ready to pounce any second. 0_o', '2003-09-29 02:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(433670, 38855, 9027, '<td valign="top">interesting filter(?) with the soft blur effect. gives it a dreamy quality. with the one lady looking directly in the camera, it''s almost like she''s the only real person and the other people reside in her dream.</td>', 'interesting filter(?) with the soft blur effect. gives it a dreamy quality. with the one lady looking directly in the camera, it''s almost like she''s the only real person and the other people reside in her dream.', '2003-09-29 02:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(433676, 38920, 9027, '<td valign="top">love the faded aspect of this image. can''t make out the figure in the foreground though.  it looks like a bald person laying on their stomach...near a bag? can''t tell.</td>', 'love the faded aspect of this image. can''t make out the figure in the foreground though.  it looks like a bald person laying on their stomach...near a bag? can''t tell.', '2003-09-29 02:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(433678, 38736, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice medium tones in the truck/shadows, though the harsh highlights in the tree are very distracting.</td>', 'nice medium tones in the truck/shadows, though the harsh highlights in the tree are very distracting.', '2003-09-29 02:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(433681, 38447, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice color use. might have also been interesting if you cropped in even closer, esp from the top.</td>', 'nice color use. might have also been interesting if you cropped in even closer, esp from the top.', '2003-09-29 02:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(433684, 39200, 9027, '<td valign="top">great repetition and lines in this. the colors are strange though. perhaps if the tones were lightened or something it would have helped.</td>', 'great repetition and lines in this. the colors are strange though. perhaps if the tones were lightened or something it would have helped.', '2003-09-29 03:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(433686, 39425, 9027, '<td valign="top">for a brush that is active 3 times a day, i''d think it''d be more frazzled. guess it is a new one. heheh. good clarity in shot.  :o)</td>', 'for a brush that is active 3 times a day, i''d think it''d be more frazzled. guess it is a new one. heheh. good clarity in shot.  :o)', '2003-09-29 03:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
