(433697, 38463, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice soft textures in the monkey on the left. and good colors. wish a cloud had momentarily passed to help soften that hot spot on the monkey on the right. :o)</td>', 'nice soft textures in the monkey on the left. and good colors. wish a cloud had momentarily passed to help soften that hot spot on the monkey on the right. :o)', '2003-09-29 03:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(433699, 39070, 9027, '<td valign="top">hahaha! great setup. looks like the guy is onstage. i guess he''s contemplating whether the egg or the chicken came first. :oP</td>', 'hahaha! great setup. looks like the guy is onstage. i guess he''s contemplating whether the egg or the chicken came first. :oP', '2003-09-29 03:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(433700, 39361, 9027, '<td valign="top">i once found my ups guy taking a break in a sandwich shop when i was tracking him down to get my package before he left me one of those awful little yellow slips... anyway, i like the closeup crop, just feel the quality is a bit off here. lots of little bitmappy parts.</td>', 'i once found my ups guy taking a break in a sandwich shop when i was tracking him down to get my package before he left me one of those awful little yellow slips... anyway, i like the closeup crop, just feel the quality is a bit off here. lots of little bitmappy parts.', '2003-09-29 03:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(433701, 38435, 9027, '<td valign="top">think this would be stronger if you had cropped out more of the uninteresting background and zoomed in on the main subject.</td>', 'think this would be stronger if you had cropped out more of the uninteresting background and zoomed in on the main subject.', '2003-09-29 03:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(433703, 39221, 9027, '<td valign="top">hahaha. a little early for halloween. image is a bit blurry and the lighting washes out certain parts. think zooming in on the guy would have been a good idea since the coffin isn''t in the best of shape.</td>', 'hahaha. a little early for halloween. image is a bit blurry and the lighting washes out certain parts. think zooming in on the guy would have been a good idea since the coffin isn''t in the best of shape.', '2003-09-29 03:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(433705, 39245, 9027, '<td valign="top">nicely composed shot. i like the contrasting textures of the dog and jeans.  the lighting also helps emphasize  that.</td>', 'nicely composed shot. i like the contrasting textures of the dog and jeans.  the lighting also helps emphasize  that.', '2003-09-29 03:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(433709, 38700, 9027, '<td valign="top">haha, very funny image! :o)<br/>too much post production (over sharpened, contrasted, etc)  ruins it though.</td>', 'haha, very funny image! :o)too much post production (over sharpened, contrasted, etc)  ruins it though.', '2003-09-29 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(433712, 38367, 7151, '<td valign="top">A nice scene, but I think a tighter crop with, more or less, just the rocker, the window and mother and baby would have had a more initmate feeling.</td>', 'A nice scene, but I think a tighter crop with, more or less, just the rocker, the window and mother and baby would have had a more initmate feeling.', '2003-09-29 03:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(433726, 39082, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. I would have cropped out the lamp post on the right side of the frame.</td>', 'Very creative idea. I would have cropped out the lamp post on the right side of the frame.', '2003-09-29 04:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(433743, 39321, 8522, '<td valign="top">Subject is blurred, and the shadow caused by the flash detracts heavily from the shot. Perhaps I''m being picky, but I don''t get a feeling of calm from this shot. There is a distracing object at the top of the subject''s head. 3<br/>ps, hope he gets better...</td>', 'Subject is blurred, and the shadow caused by the flash detracts heavily from the shot. Perhaps I''m being picky, but I don''t get a feeling of calm from this shot. There is a distracing object at the top of the subject''s head. 3ps, hope he gets better...', '2003-09-29 06:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(433746, 39196, 8522, '<td valign="top">Photo could definitely do with more tonal contrast. Composition feels very chaotic to me. The pipe, glass and foreground chess pieces all seem to blend into each other, which lessens the impact of the shot. More could have been made of the refraction in the glass. Background needs to be more black. You need to find a way of avoiding the glare on the glass and pipe. Nice idea though... 5</td>', 'Photo could definitely do with more tonal contrast. Composition feels very chaotic to me. The pipe, glass and foreground chess pieces all seem to blend into each other, which lessens the impact of the shot. More could have been made of the refraction in the glass. Background needs to be more black. You need to find a way of avoiding the glare on the glass and pipe. Nice idea though... 5', '2003-09-29 06:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(433747, 38979, 8522, '<td valign="top">Probably a superb photo, if it was large enough for me to tell. 4</td>', 'Probably a superb photo, if it was large enough for me to tell. 4', '2003-09-29 06:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(433752, 39141, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame you didn''t expose for the highlights and then adjust in Photoshop, as you''ve got unfortunate burnt out highlights here. Great light, interesting composition. Very attractive model! A very effective intimate portrait. 7<br/>Edit: Another shot where I''m mystified that my comment is one of the few not marked as helpful.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-07 09:45:29.</i></td>', 'Shame you didn''t expose for the highlights and then adjust in Photoshop, as you''ve got unfortunate burnt out highlights here. Great light, interesting composition. Very attractive model! A very effective intimate portrait. 7Edit: Another shot where I''m mystified that my comment is one of the few not marked as helpful.', '2003-09-29 06:46:30.000000', '2003-10-07 10:45:29.000000', 1),
(433757, 39247, 8522, '<td valign="top">This dolphin does not appear to be placed, seated, or lying stably, and I don''t get a feeling of calm. 3</td>', 'This dolphin does not appear to be placed, seated, or lying stably, and I don''t get a feeling of calm. 3', '2003-09-29 07:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(433758, 39100, 8522, '<td valign="top">Existing artwork. 1</td>', 'Existing artwork. 1', '2003-09-29 07:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(433759, 39296, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, not sure about the sepia toning though, I think I''d have prefered normal b&amp;w.<br/>I''d have also prefered the gamma a bit darker. 7</td>', 'Great shot, not sure about the sepia toning though, I think I''d have prefered normal b&w.I''d have also prefered the gamma a bit darker. 7', '2003-09-29 07:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(433760, 39412, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, I really wish that the crop was tighter though, I can''t see the point of including anything left of his bag. Possibly a little over-NeatImaged. The pigeons are a really great touch. Shame about the levels of glare. 7</td>', 'Wonderful photo, I really wish that the crop was tighter though, I can''t see the point of including anything left of his bag. Possibly a little over-NeatImaged. The pigeons are a really great touch. Shame about the levels of glare. 7', '2003-09-29 07:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(433761, 38268, 8522, '<td valign="top">Don''t see anything placed, seated, or lying stably. 3</td>', 'Don''t see anything placed, seated, or lying stably. 3', '2003-09-29 07:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(433773, 38801, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... unusual but effective composition, great light and shadow, good use of duotone with a well chosen hue. This photo evokes a wonderful mood. I won''t be surprised to see this win a ribbon. 10</td>', 'Beautiful... unusual but effective composition, great light and shadow, good use of duotone with a well chosen hue. This photo evokes a wonderful mood. I won''t be surprised to see this win a ribbon. 10', '2003-09-29 08:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(433779, 38715, 8522, '<td valign="top">My favourite shot this challenge, just fantastic. Beautiful textures, colours and use of light. Although the cat''s face is JUST out of focus, this looks deliberate and is very effective. The sharp focus of the material in the foreground looks great, especially with such a narrow dof. If only every pet picture this challenge had such a thought out background. Everything is exposed perfectly, difficult given the large range of tones here. Well done. 10</td>', 'My favourite shot this challenge, just fantastic. Beautiful textures, colours and use of light. Although the cat''s face is JUST out of focus, this looks deliberate and is very effective. The sharp focus of the material in the foreground looks great, especially with such a narrow dof. If only every pet picture this challenge had such a thought out background. Everything is exposed perfectly, difficult given the large range of tones here. Well done. 10', '2003-09-29 08:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(433783, 39070, 8522, '<td valign="top">This was the first shot that came up when I started voting. Things went rapidly downhill! Very inventive shot, original is an understatement. SUPERB use of light and shadow, the composition is excellent. 10</td>', 'This was the first shot that came up when I started voting. Things went rapidly downhill! Very inventive shot, original is an understatement. SUPERB use of light and shadow, the composition is excellent. 10', '2003-09-29 08:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
