(434814, 39373, 9437, '<td valign="top">Love this pet portrait! I like the expression on his face and the texture in the fur. Reminds me of our frisbee tourneys in the back yard.</td>', 'Love this pet portrait! I like the expression on his face and the texture in the fur. Reminds me of our frisbee tourneys in the back yard.', '2003-09-29 23:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(434818, 39074, 9437, '<td valign="top">good composition. Just the right amount of head room.</td>', 'good composition. Just the right amount of head room.', '2003-09-29 23:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(434824, 39337, 10985, '<td valign="top">Not much rest here, I can tell you that. This is not an easy job! Great photo, though.</td>', 'Not much rest here, I can tell you that. This is not an easy job! Great photo, though.', '2003-09-29 23:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(434838, 38383, 6477, '<td valign="top">This is a great monument, and I think you took it at the right time of the day... congrats!</td>', 'This is a great monument, and I think you took it at the right time of the day... congrats!', '2003-09-29 23:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(434869, 38993, 11073, '<td valign="top">great photo - but his one leg in the air give me the impression that he''s moving - if he''s not, it still looks that way.  However, that said, I grew up working on a christmas tree farm as a kid, and I know for a fact that a praying mantis can sit very still for a very long time...so I will give the benfit of the doubt.  I just hope that other people don''t judge poorly for the same reason as my initial reaciton.  I like the dof, and the framing - very good imo.  the textured surface is nice...almost looks like a paper towel or something. nice.  sharp and clear. nice work. 8.</td>', 'great photo - but his one leg in the air give me the impression that he''s moving - if he''s not, it still looks that way.  However, that said, I grew up working on a christmas tree farm as a kid, and I know for a fact that a praying mantis can sit very still for a very long time...so I will give the benfit of the doubt.  I just hope that other people don''t judge poorly for the same reason as my initial reaciton.  I like the dof, and the framing - very good imo.  the textured surface is nice...almost looks like a paper towel or something. nice.  sharp and clear. nice work. 8.', '2003-09-30 00:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(434873, 38894, 11073, '<td valign="top">maybe try putting the camera on the ground to get a more interesting view point.</td>', 'maybe try putting the camera on the ground to get a more interesting view point.', '2003-09-30 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(434876, 38715, 11073, '<td valign="top">great shot.  this is only one of the first "pet" pics that i have seen, and can already tell that there won''t be many better, if any.  good dof, and composition.  the textured material is nice too. it looks like a pair of jeans or something? nice work.</td>', 'great shot.  this is only one of the first "pet" pics that i have seen, and can already tell that there won''t be many better, if any.  good dof, and composition.  the textured material is nice too. it looks like a pair of jeans or something? nice work.', '2003-09-30 00:22:26.000000', NULL, 1);
