(434916, 39035, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the rocky beach and the rippling water. The contrast is about right but it could use some sharpening. The sunbather needs be closer to the right side of the frame. Two sunbathers would be even better.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the rocky beach and the rippling water. The contrast is about right but it could use some sharpening. The sunbather needs be closer to the right side of the frame. Two sunbathers would be even better.', '2003-09-30 00:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(434920, 38901, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Could use more interesting lighting and maybe a bit of sharpening. A neutral colored frame would better complement the photo.</td>', 'Good composition. Could use more interesting lighting and maybe a bit of sharpening. A neutral colored frame would better complement the photo.', '2003-09-30 00:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(434922, 38661, 4767, '<td valign="top">cute puppy</td>', 'cute puppy', '2003-09-30 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(434924, 39361, 4767, '<td valign="top">(Is this going to get someone fired???)</td>', '(Is this going to get someone fired???)', '2003-09-30 00:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434928, 39387, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like how the model''s body parallels the surfboard. Too bad the shoes didn''t do the same. The sun is at jus the right angle and low enough to bring out the texture of the sand. A little sharpening would help.</td>', 'I like how the model''s body parallels the surfboard. Too bad the shoes didn''t do the same. The sun is at jus the right angle and low enough to bring out the texture of the sand. A little sharpening would help.', '2003-09-30 01:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434933, 38229, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The model is well posed and the color of her outfit makes here the obvious center of interest. The viewer sees her first, then follows her gaze to the surfboards, whose lines direct the attention right back to the subject.</td>', 'Great composition. The model is well posed and the color of her outfit makes here the obvious center of interest. The viewer sees her first, then follows her gaze to the surfboards, whose lines direct the attention right back to the subject.', '2003-09-30 01:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(434942, 39348, 12681, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, even showing the hair in the ears and the whiskers. Neutral background and foreground make the cat really stand out.</td>', 'Nice detail, even showing the hair in the ears and the whiskers. Neutral background and foreground make the cat really stand out.', '2003-09-30 01:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(434943, 39070, 12681, '<td valign="top">Cute &amp; original idea</td>', 'Cute & original idea', '2003-09-30 01:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434946, 38993, 12681, '<td valign="top">Nice detail with such a small subject. The neutral &amp; blurred background make the subject pop out.</td>', 'Nice detail with such a small subject. The neutral & blurred background make the subject pop out.', '2003-09-30 01:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434948, 38446, 12681, '<td valign="top">Nice candid quality</td>', 'Nice candid quality', '2003-09-30 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
