(435830, 39281, 4871, '<td valign="top">If this had have been executed better (ie focus right and lighting manipulated to suit) and the crop not so savage top and bottom, this may have been a great shot. The DOF would have been nice with the other cat in the BKG.</td>', 'If this had have been executed better (ie focus right and lighting manipulated to suit) and the crop not so savage top and bottom, this may have been a great shot. The DOF would have been nice with the other cat in the BKG.', '2003-09-30 22:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(435832, 39198, 4871, '<td valign="top">Amazing!!! I love it! Wonderful lighting and exposure - the detail is fantastic! This is my favourite thus far!</td>', 'Amazing!!! I love it! Wonderful lighting and exposure - the detail is fantastic! This is my favourite thus far!', '2003-09-30 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(435833, 38372, 4871, '<td valign="top">Great idea and photo. Watch your thirds. As your subject is looking to the right, he should be positioned in the left hand third looking into the space.</td>', 'Great idea and photo. Watch your thirds. As your subject is looking to the right, he should be positioned in the left hand third looking into the space.', '2003-09-30 23:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435836, 39409, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings... I think this is a great theme for this challenge.  I love the theme of candlelight and champagne.  I think the lighting here is an issue.  It looks like you went to great lengths to create some interesting lighting for this photo and you are almost there :)  I would love to see that candlelight illuminating your model''s face and the suds in the tub as well.  Doing that would require having a lot of candlelight behind you or possibly using a large mirror to reflect it back in the other direction.  Another really cool effect that could work here would be a submersible light of some sort that would light up the tub with a similar light color as the candles.  Excellent work... = 8</td>', 'Greetings... I think this is a great theme for this challenge.  I love the theme of candlelight and champagne.  I think the lighting here is an issue.  It looks like you went to great lengths to create some interesting lighting for this photo and you are almost there :)  I would love to see that candlelight illuminating your model''s face and the suds in the tub as well.  Doing that would require having a lot of candlelight behind you or possibly using a large mirror to reflect it back in the other direction.  Another really cool effect that could work here would be a submersible light of some sort that would light up the tub with a similar light color as the candles.  Excellent work... = 8', '2003-09-30 23:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435837, 39090, 4871, '<td valign="top">There are too many hot spots on this photograph. If your camera has exposure lock and is able to be changed to spot, you should set it to spot and take your reading from the brightest point of the photo - ie the lizards back. Otherwise its taking the luminance of the entire photo and takes it to 17% gray (or something like that) Could have been a great shot otherwise!</td>', 'There are too many hot spots on this photograph. If your camera has exposure lock and is able to be changed to spot, you should set it to spot and take your reading from the brightest point of the photo - ie the lizards back. Otherwise its taking the luminance of the entire photo and takes it to 17% gray (or something like that) Could have been a great shot otherwise!', '2003-09-30 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(435838, 39223, 4871, '<td valign="top">LOL! Great!!!</td>', 'LOL! Great!!!', '2003-09-30 23:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(435839, 38235, 4871, '<td valign="top">Eeugh!! Sorry, but I really don''t like the color adjustment that you''ve done on this. Color adjustments should be subtly used to draw highlights or achieve a look that''s better than original - I daresay the original would have looked better.</td>', 'Eeugh!! Sorry, but I really don''t like the color adjustment that you''ve done on this. Color adjustments should be subtly used to draw highlights or achieve a look that''s better than original - I daresay the original would have looked better.', '2003-09-30 23:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
