(435983, 39015, 12180, '<td valign="top">okay well here is a breakdown of what this photo is. first off yes it is a journalism type shot .. that is what kind i take ... if i see it i shoot it ... the truck attempted to squeeze through a small bridge and barely made it .. but caught one of the rear wheels on an embankment under the bridge .. causing it to hit the bridge ... the driver pulled the truck from under the bridge ... but then it broke in half once on the other side .. and sits "at rest" till someone can come and tow it off ... <br/> <br/>oh, none of my shots are ment to be artistic ... they are ment to inform and convey what i saw... :) <br/> <br/></td>', 'okay well here is a breakdown of what this photo is. first off yes it is a journalism type shot .. that is what kind i take ... if i see it i shoot it ... the truck attempted to squeeze through a small bridge and barely made it .. but caught one of the rear wheels on an embankment under the bridge .. causing it to hit the bridge ... the driver pulled the truck from under the bridge ... but then it broke in half once on the other side .. and sits "at rest" till someone can come and tow it off ...  oh, none of my shots are ment to be artistic ... they are ment to inform and convey what i saw... :)  ', '2003-10-01 01:19:21.000000', NULL, 0),
