(436004, 39353, 9893, '<td valign="top">Wow Jon, remember how there used to be all of those "most underrated award" forums? Yep, you''d get mine. It meets the challenge... because yeah there are motion blurs, but they''re at rest now! Sorry some people didn''t see the contrast ;)<br/>(I gave ya a 8)</td>', 'Wow Jon, remember how there used to be all of those "most underrated award" forums? Yep, you''d get mine. It meets the challenge... because yeah there are motion blurs, but they''re at rest now! Sorry some people didn''t see the contrast ;)(I gave ya a 8)', '2003-10-01 01:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
