(436691, 38715, 3087, '<td valign="top">Thanks to Bob for highlighting this. It''s one I didn''t reach when viewing At Rest entries - I got through about half and commented on those I liked.<br/> <br/>This is a lovely image - fantastic use of DOF, great low perspective, strong off-centre composition, great use of diagonal. Colour feels a little over-saturated but that''s a minor point.<br/></td>', 'Thanks to Bob for highlighting this. It''s one I didn''t reach when viewing At Rest entries - I got through about half and commented on those I liked. This is a lovely image - fantastic use of DOF, great low perspective, strong off-centre composition, great use of diagonal. Colour feels a little over-saturated but that''s a minor point.', '2003-10-01 11:35:21.000000', NULL, 0),
