(436820, 38423, 6536, '<td valign="top">Hi glimpses, this is a very nice shot. I''m not sure why it scored so low. I like the black &amp; white with some color effect. I also like the slight yellow tint on the front of the car it makes it more interesting. It has nice composition and DOF. It makes a good stock or still life shot. Good job.</td>', 'Hi glimpses, this is a very nice shot. I''m not sure why it scored so low. I like the black & white with some color effect. I also like the slight yellow tint on the front of the car it makes it more interesting. It has nice composition and DOF. It makes a good stock or still life shot. Good job.', '2003-10-01 12:56:07.000000', NULL, 0),
