(436895, 39370, 1005, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot, Renee!  The focus is very sharp!  And the colors are so very rich.  I can''t see how this didn''t score better.  (didn''t vote this one myself)  The closest thing to a complaint I could see in this is the glare off his body, other than that, it''s perfect.  (I''ll read the other comments...)<br/>O.K. it seems most didn''t "get it".  I don''t understand why people cannot vote each picture on it''s own merits.  (Saying it''s cliche, or should have been in a recent challenge just aggrevate me.)  <br/>As for the background...this might have been a good shot for a really narrow DOF, say F-3 or F-3.2 or there abouts.  Blurs out more background and so, adds emphasis on the subject.  I like seeing the environment, but I guess photographically, it''s not that good.</td>', 'Spectacular shot, Renee!  The focus is very sharp!  And the colors are so very rich.  I can''t see how this didn''t score better.  (didn''t vote this one myself)  The closest thing to a complaint I could see in this is the glare off his body, other than that, it''s perfect.  (I''ll read the other comments...)O.K. it seems most didn''t "get it".  I don''t understand why people cannot vote each picture on it''s own merits.  (Saying it''s cliche, or should have been in a recent challenge just aggrevate me.)  As for the background...this might have been a good shot for a really narrow DOF, say F-3 or F-3.2 or there abouts.  Blurs out more background and so, adds emphasis on the subject.  I like seeing the environment, but I guess photographically, it''s not that good.', '2003-10-01 13:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(436900, 38993, 1143, '<td valign="top">I''m a little annoyed at all the "this isn''t rest" comments and votes. An animal or bird sitting is at rest, but a bug isn''t?<br/>Mantids are very passive hunters that usually just sit still and wait for something to get close enough to grab. Other than moving some legs up and down, this one didn''t move for about twenty minutes.<br/>Shot at 1/5sec.<br/>Maybe it''s too bright and colorful to convey a restful feeling, but the bug definitely IS resting.</td>', 'I''m a little annoyed at all the "this isn''t rest" comments and votes. An animal or bird sitting is at rest, but a bug isn''t?Mantids are very passive hunters that usually just sit still and wait for something to get close enough to grab. Other than moving some legs up and down, this one didn''t move for about twenty minutes.Shot at 1/5sec.Maybe it''s too bright and colorful to convey a restful feeling, but the bug definitely IS resting.', '2003-10-01 13:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(436907, 38656, 10263, '<td valign="top">Congratulations of being in the top 10!! Very good. I expect to see you in the top 3 soon :)</td>', 'Congratulations of being in the top 10!! Very good. I expect to see you in the top 3 soon :)', '2003-10-01 13:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(436925, 39082, 12428, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for ur Kind comments, I appreciate them all, Ya I do agree the streetlamp should be cropped off. I was in a car then, and I stopped in the middle of a not-too-busy road to get this so I did not have alot of time to position my camera well enough, will take note of all comments made so far, Once again thanks all. =)</td>', 'Thanks all for ur Kind comments, I appreciate them all, Ya I do agree the streetlamp should be cropped off. I was in a car then, and I stopped in the middle of a not-too-busy road to get this so I did not have alot of time to position my camera well enough, will take note of all comments made so far, Once again thanks all. =)', '2003-10-01 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
