(437037, 38401, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good framing and high technical quality. B&amp;W and a solid white background works very well with this image. I gave it a 6.<br/> <br/>The subject is both placed nicely and sitting. The subject is not moving. Perhaps there is cultural misinterpretation here, but this subject appears to me to emanate an inner aura of peace and confident calm that is difficult to capture in an image.<br/> <br/>For me that means it meets the challenge. Apparently it does not for many others. That is to bad. This is a good shot and deserving of a much higher score.</td>', 'Good framing and high technical quality. B&W and a solid white background works very well with this image. I gave it a 6. The subject is both placed nicely and sitting. The subject is not moving. Perhaps there is cultural misinterpretation here, but this subject appears to me to emanate an inner aura of peace and confident calm that is difficult to capture in an image. For me that means it meets the challenge. Apparently it does not for many others. That is to bad. This is a good shot and deserving of a much higher score.', '2003-10-01 14:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(437101, 39141, 3867, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who voted and commented.  Special thanks to those who thought it was going to be a winner.  Sorry to disappoint.<br/>I''d really like to hear some comments from those six people who voted this a one and would like to know what they thought was so terribly wrong with the photo.</td>', 'Thanks to all who voted and commented.  Special thanks to those who thought it was going to be a winner.  Sorry to disappoint.I''d really like to hear some comments from those six people who voted this a one and would like to know what they thought was so terribly wrong with the photo.', '2003-10-01 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(437114, 39296, 3447, '<td valign="top">Great capture Gary.   I carry my camera around with me a lot hoping to get a picture of real humanity like this one.  Others may quibble about technical issues but this is the kind of photograph which will last, and be meaningful in anyone''s album.</td>', 'Great capture Gary.   I carry my camera around with me a lot hoping to get a picture of real humanity like this one.  Others may quibble about technical issues but this is the kind of photograph which will last, and be meaningful in anyone''s album.', '2003-10-01 15:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(437138, 39404, 12131, '<td valign="top">This rocks, congratulations!!!!!</td>', 'This rocks, congratulations!!!!!', '2003-10-01 16:38:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(437154, 39367, 12131, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry about the results you got.  I really thought this was funny and creative as far as rest goes.  I don''t think the bathroom itself looks dirty, actually its very clean, but I do think that the photograph was a little too sharp or grainy.  Good effort.  I do think this was worth a good laugh.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'I''m sorry about the results you got.  I really thought this was funny and creative as far as rest goes.  I don''t think the bathroom itself looks dirty, actually its very clean, but I do think that the photograph was a little too sharp or grainy.  Good effort.  I do think this was worth a good laugh.  Better luck next time.', '2003-10-01 16:57:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(437202, 38423, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Couldn''t tell you why the so many scored this a 5 or a 4, I would have gone at least 7, maybe 8, but I didn''t vote this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Couldn''t tell you why the so many scored this a 5 or a 4, I would have gone at least 7, maybe 8, but I didn''t vote this challenge.', '2003-10-01 17:44:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(437213, 38629, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hey that''s nice! The ONLY thing that might have helped is if both kayakers had their paddles down. The one on the left could be drifting in that pose, but could be paddling too, and that probably hurt with cranky people looking for a reason to knock off a point or two.<br/> <br/>I like the lighting/coloring and soft look you gave it as well.</td>', 'Hey that''s nice! The ONLY thing that might have helped is if both kayakers had their paddles down. The one on the left could be drifting in that pose, but could be paddling too, and that probably hurt with cranky people looking for a reason to knock off a point or two. I like the lighting/coloring and soft look you gave it as well.', '2003-10-01 17:51:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(437215, 39420, 6349, '<td valign="top">wow, this should have done better.  I love the lighting and the subtle shades of blue.  It feels cool, yet at the same time warm and inviting.  It definetely portrays a sense of calm to me even if the model doesn''t look like she is actually, "resting" as in sleeping, she is still at rest.  When shots like this don''t break 6 I have no idea what the voters are thinking.</td>', 'wow, this should have done better.  I love the lighting and the subtle shades of blue.  It feels cool, yet at the same time warm and inviting.  It definetely portrays a sense of calm to me even if the model doesn''t look like she is actually, "resting" as in sleeping, she is still at rest.  When shots like this don''t break 6 I have no idea what the voters are thinking.', '2003-10-01 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(437235, 38629, 6349, '<td valign="top">Indeed, thanks GeneralE, I think that might have been the case.  Of course, even when you''re drifing in a kayak you''ve got to keep a paddle in the water or the waves will twist you around.  That is assuming you want to stay facing in a particular direction.</td>', 'Indeed, thanks GeneralE, I think that might have been the case.  Of course, even when you''re drifing in a kayak you''ve got to keep a paddle in the water or the waves will twist you around.  That is assuming you want to stay facing in a particular direction.', '2003-10-01 17:59:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(437261, 38629, 656, '<td valign="top">This is great - shame about the bizzare score, but still a great shot.</td>', 'This is great - shame about the bizzare score, but still a great shot.', '2003-10-01 18:11:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(437268, 39420, 5728, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why your photos are not doing better than they are. For me you have deserved a ribbon long ago. Everyone of your last photos have been of ribbon quality, I personally do not understand what is wrong here.</td>', 'I have no idea why your photos are not doing better than they are. For me you have deserved a ribbon long ago. Everyone of your last photos have been of ribbon quality, I personally do not understand what is wrong here.', '2003-10-01 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
