(691280, 39068, 16703, '<td valign="top">GREETINGS FROM "happy world of criticism club by mehmet"<br/> <br/>i really like this image. it sparks two diferent feelings in me, first one is that the woman on the bed is sleeping and the thoughts of peace and quiet comes to mind, and second is that the woman on bed is day dreaming,sort of like closing her eyes and reflecting on thoughts, which gives it a feeling of lonelines and sadness and bitterness. i love the tone and the contrast, i like high contrast in images in general. lighting is suberb and the model is breathtaking..positioning of the model and/or the cropping does a perfect job of enhancing this image. ..trully a great image.. bravo for a suberb capture heida... <br/> <br/>"a better world through subjective criticism...</td>', 'GREETINGS FROM "happy world of criticism club by mehmet" i really like this image. it sparks two diferent feelings in me, first one is that the woman on the bed is sleeping and the thoughts of peace and quiet comes to mind, and second is that the woman on bed is day dreaming,sort of like closing her eyes and reflecting on thoughts, which gives it a feeling of lonelines and sadness and bitterness. i love the tone and the contrast, i like high contrast in images in general. lighting is suberb and the model is breathtaking..positioning of the model and/or the cropping does a perfect job of enhancing this image. ..trully a great image.. bravo for a suberb capture heida...  "a better world through subjective criticism...', '2004-04-30 00:45:59.000000', NULL, 0),
